  - m_Id: 23515512964112384
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112385
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112386
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112387
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112388
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112389
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112390
    m_Localized: 放过她
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112391
    m_Localized: 拿出你的枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112392
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 这就是结局。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112393
    m_Localized: 射杀她
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112394
    m_Localized: 放过她
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112395
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112396
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112397
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112398
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112399
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112400
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112401
    m_Localized: 放过她
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112402
    m_Localized: 拿出你的枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112403
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 这就是结局。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512964112404
    m_Localized: 射杀她
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23515512968306688
    m_Localized: 放过她
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341248
    m_Localized: 'Firefighter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341249
    m_Localized: 'Firefighter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341250
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 想看就看吧。不过提醒你一下……给我做检查，可能会让你发现还是不知道为好的真相。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341251
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341252
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341253
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341254
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341255
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341256
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341257
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 来，看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341258
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341259
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 都是啃铅笔啃的，我也就是习惯不好……应该没事吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341260
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 你看我这牙……裂开了，还有血，都是啃铅笔啃的。我也就是习惯不好……应该没事吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341261
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341262
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341263
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341264
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341265
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 看见指甲缝里的印子没有？那是墨水，一沾上就渗进了毛孔里。粗糙的皮肤是我追求知识的代价。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341266
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 看见指甲缝里的印子没有？那是墨水，一沾上就渗进了毛孔里。我为了追求知识……付出了沉重的代价。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341267
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341268
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341269
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 噢，是得看眼睛，来，看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341270
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341271
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 还是蓝的，说明他们还没对我下手。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341272
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 面对一大堆真相，必须睁大双眼，趁它们还没改写现实，把一切尽收眼底。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341273
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 我眼中的世界没有滤镜，没有迷雾，就是它原本的样子。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341274
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341275
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341276
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 腋下？……头一次见有人想看这地方。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341277
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341278
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 看见腋毛没？人体的天然屏障，能减缓蒸发，保留盐分。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341279
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 有人会刮掉，但他们压根不知道，没了腋毛，出了汗更麻烦。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341280
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341281
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341282
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 拍照？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341283
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341284
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 照片不是我的一部分，想改就能改，想抹掉就能抹掉。不过……记录下来的这一刻，他们可够不着。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341285
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341286
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341287
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 要看耳朵？明白了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341288
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341289
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 你可能听过那唯一一次说出了真相的新闻报道。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341290
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 看我有没有伪人的特征？别担心，我早就做好防护措施了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341291
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341292
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341293
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 开枪吧。不过你要小心，他们说不准也会偷偷往你嘴里加点儿什么东西。吃的早就不仅仅只是吃的了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341294
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341295
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341296
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 你害怕寻找真相的人？那你害怕的不是我，是你自己。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341297
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341298
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341299
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 武器只是控制他人的工具，这你知道吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341300
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341301
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341302
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 让我举起手来？你有没有想过，为什么世界各地都是用举起双手表示投降？这个规矩是谁定的？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341303
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341304
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341305
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 想毁了这张照片？还是想抹掉照片里的人？你最好想想，是谁让你有这种想法的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341306
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341307
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341308
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 耳朵上有这个，确实有可能会让耳朵跟枪声产生共振，不过……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341309
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 你要瞄准就瞄准伪人去，他们会跟枪声产生不一样的共振！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341310
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 想让我闭嘴？你觉得我闭嘴了，事情就简单了？不过让人闭嘴也是控制人的工具。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341311
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341312
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341313
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 你知道补牙用的填充物，能塞得下微型天线吗？有的国家已经有实证了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341314
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 牙齿的缝隙放显微镜下一看，就能看得出来……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341315
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 有没有伪人才会有的痕迹。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341316
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 有人跟我说过这么一句话：“你掌握了真相，就要做好被人夺走的准备。”但我会紧紧守护真相到最后一刻。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341317
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 凝视真相够久，真相也会凝视你。你从我的眼睛里看到真相了么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341318
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 大家都不喜欢腋下的气味，可再怎么说，那起码是天然的。你知道么，人造香水不过是操控人的工具。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341319
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 香水的气味会转移人的注意力，掩盖真相。所有东西都该散发真实的味道。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341320
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 照片是锚点，能把我们固定在现实里，证明我们来过，存在过，所以照片很危险。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341321
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 你知道么，他们用声音来操控我们。频率、次声和节奏，都能改变人的思维。不过我已经学会了透过噪音，去听真实的声音。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341322
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 我死了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341323
    m_Localized: 'Theorist: 真相也不会死。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341324
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 唔，要检查就检查，动作快点，我忙得很。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341325
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341326
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341327
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341328
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341329
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341330
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341331
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 来，看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341332
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341333
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 看见没？整整齐齐，跟栏杆一样，每颗都白净得像雪，这牙多好，跟洋娃娃嘴里的一样完美。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341334
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 不过就一点不好，牙龈……偏偏出了点儿血。烟抽多了害的。神经一紧张就爱多抽几口。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341335
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341336
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341337
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341338
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341339
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 怎么样？你也知道，眼下这世道，谁还有闲工夫把指甲弄得漂漂亮亮的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341340
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341341
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341342
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 屋里空气太干燥了，弄得我老眨眼。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341343
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341344
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 清澈碧绿，还泛着泪光。我老公进了应急中心，我高兴得眼泪都流出来了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341345
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 怎么样，不错吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341346
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 清澈碧绿。怎么，你以为我眼睛会有点儿浑浊？唔……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341347
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341348
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341349
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 你这什么表情？来，随便看，别不好意思。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341350
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341351
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 我老公走之前我抱了他一下，第二天我就浑身痒。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341352
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 混账东西，到底给我传染了什么病？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341353
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 我又不是来T台走秀的，怎么舒服怎么来。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341354
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341355
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341356
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 拍吧，别给我老公看就行，嘻嘻。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341357
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341358
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 天呐……你是想看什么？杂志里的插页照片么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341359
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341360
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341361
    m_Localized: 看吧。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341362
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341363
    m_Localized: 你说耳环？唔，有时候得有点儿淑女范。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341364
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341365
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341366
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 搞什么鬼？给你看了下牙齿，就用枪指着我？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341367
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341368
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341369
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 喂，别这样！我指甲怎么了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341370
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341371
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341372
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 嫌我眼睛不够白？哈，你这种人我也是头一次见。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341373
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 不喜欢我眼睛就掏枪？哈，你这种人我也是头一次见。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341374
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 把你那玩具收起来，我们该干嘛干嘛去吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341375
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341376
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341377
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 你去找他，问问他给我传染了什么病！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341378
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 没必要拿枪指着我。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341379
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 哈，等我老公找上你你就知道错，放聪明点！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341380
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341381
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341382
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 什么情况，你就好这口？还是说怕我老公怕得要死？？？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341383
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341384
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341385
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 怎么，你跟耳环过不去？不喜欢耳环？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341386
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341387
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341388
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 笑容就是女人的骄傲。你说出血？谁牙龈没出血过。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341389
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 呵，动不动跟人掏枪，还以为自己能过安生日子？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341390
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 我的手是干活用的，不是给人欣赏的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341391
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 希望你能找点儿活干干……比如用脸擦地板。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341392
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 应急中心要是招我进去，我会好好大干一场！一公里外的伪人，我也能一下找出来。至于你这种人，那更不在话下，三下五除二就收拾了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341393
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 男人总爱说什么，把自己打扮得漂漂亮亮的是女人的义务。我只想进应急中心，漂不漂亮的我不在乎，懒得管这有的没的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341394
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 呜，照片出卖了我，我怕死了！哈！你肯定吓得浑身发抖，差点儿就要扣动扳机了。你就不担心自己搞错了吗，大法官？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341395
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 东西小，意义可不小，比如说我这耳环，能提醒我自己是谁。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341396
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 我是个女人，是个人类。你呢？拿枪指着我，把我说得跟什么野兽一样。你不觉得自己变成这样很可怕吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341397
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 你知不知道，你就是个怪胎！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341398
    m_Localized: 'Wife应急中心: 我老公要是在……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341399
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 对，是该检查一下。谢谢你，多亏你做事够仔细。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341400
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341401
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341402
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341403
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341404
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341405
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341406
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 啊……看牙齿？好。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341407
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341408
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 你别误会，我不是……呃……不是伪人，只不过……对外表不怎么上心。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341409
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 裂开了，还有血……我知道不好看，都是啃铅笔啃的。我也就是习惯不好……应该没事吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341410
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341411
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341412
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 好吧……非得看……那就看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341413
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341414
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 嗯……不太好看，我以前都尽量藏着，不给人看。现在也没什么好藏的了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341415
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341416
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341417
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 我……我是没工夫打理。天天忙着逃命，找地方躲。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341418
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341419
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341420
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341421
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 别……别吓到就行。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341422
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341423
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 眼睛这样不是哭出来的，是没睡好。你也知道为什么睡不好，对不对？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341424
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 这两颗眼珠以前像被困住的老鼠一样，四处扫视，忙着找逃跑的路。可现在……它们累了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341425
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341426
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341427
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 你确定非看不可？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341428
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341429
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 没什么奇怪的地方。我连汗都出得少了，估计是太害怕了，怕得汗都不敢出。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341430
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341431
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341432
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 为什么要拍我？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341433
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 我不想拍照。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341434
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341435
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 欸、欸，没必要拿枪指着我！想拍就拍吧，我能怎么样呢……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341436
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341437
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 希望照片看着……还过得去，起码别太可怜。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341438
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341439
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341440
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 没问题。不过，你不是想看到什么……不好的东西，才让我给你看的吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341441
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341442
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 该听的不该听的都听得见。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341443
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341444
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341445
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 噢！我……没想到你遇到事情……是这么处理的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341446
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 不过你做得对，有时候开枪比微笑更管用。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341447
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341448
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341449
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 你觉得这双手很危险么？我觉得很没用。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341450
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 开枪吧，这双手什么也抓不住了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341451
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 等等！我没有，'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341452
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: ……好吧。我或许错就错在……没用这双手干过一件事吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341453
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341454
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341455
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 你看也知道……我基本上没怎么睡过觉。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341456
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 你说不定……能让我睡着？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341457
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341458
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341459
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 我看着没什么威胁性……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341460
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 但不是每个人面对枪口，都能保持冷静的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341461
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 你总有一天会碰上反手夺下枪的人，到时候……你就玩儿完了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341462
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341463
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341464
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 你通过照片能确定我是伪人的话……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341465
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 那扣动扳机是明智的选择。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341466
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341467
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341468
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341469
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341470
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341471
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 我小时候特别怕看牙医，怕到发抖、冒冷汗什么的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341472
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 有一天，有个混混把我牙打掉了。你知道我做了什么才让人打掉了牙么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341473
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 什么都没做。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341474
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 我什么都没做。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341475
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 我怕得要命，不敢反抗……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341476
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 有一天，有个混混把我牙打掉了。从那以后，我就暗暗发誓，不能变强大的话，起码要做到没有瑕疵。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341477
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 刷牙洗牙成了我的盔甲，好像牙齿的干净程度，跟我的人生价值挂上了钩。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341478
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 嗯，是有点儿傻。你说……我是不是该从这件事里悟出点儿别的来才对？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341479
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 我吓得动不了……错过了机会……就会把手用力往墙上砸，砸到出血。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341480
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 好像痛苦能洗刷掉懦弱，好像我惩罚自己惩罚得越狠，得到的力量就越多一样。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341481
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 可我得到的只有指甲缝里的泥巴，还有伤口流出来的脓。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341482
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 说来也公平，毕竟我没比我瞧不起的人好多少。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341483
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 我一紧张，就会攥紧拳头，攥到指节发白，觉得只要能控制住自己的身体，就能赶走恐惧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341484
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 我现在……都把手藏着，免得让人看见我的手在发抖。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341485
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 我、我在巷子里看见那个男人的时候……他看我的眼神就跟你现在一模一样，直勾勾盯着，能把人看穿。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341486
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 我就想……我要是也能用这种眼神看人，同学说不定就不会欺负我了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341487
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 我说不定应该多多还手才是……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341488
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 对不起，我……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341489
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 你可能不想听我说这些吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341490
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 我以前总想着做个不起眼的普通人，身上没怪味，做事规矩，从不出格。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341491
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 可我现在知道了……你不起眼，第一个被吃掉的就是你。所以……我要变个样，不做不起眼的普通人了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341492
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 自己的脸被记录在了纸上，感觉还挺奇怪的。你说这东西叫什么来着，磁场？那你已经知道我到底是人类还是伪人了吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341493
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 我还有没有机会变好？我已经成了伪人了么？还是说，我到死都是这个摇摆不定的样子……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341494
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 我以前听人说，我们都是“非人类”。那时候起我就一直很害怕……怕那个人说的是真的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341495
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 我不是人类，也不是伪人……只是个没有完成转变的生物。给……给我个改正的机会，不然……就帮我结束这一切吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341496
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 看来我只能当个……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341497
    m_Localized: 'Raskolnikov: 受害者了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341498
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 看来考验我的并非只有上帝……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341499
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341500
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341501
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341502
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341503
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341504
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341505
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 唔，非要看那就看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341506
    m_Localized: 'Nun: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341507
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 别害怕。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341508
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 孩子，罪孽可不是拿来细嚼慢咽、慢慢品味的……我都是整个儿吞下去的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341509
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341510
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341511
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 非得要看，那就看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341512
    m_Localized: 'Nun: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341513
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 年纪大了，再加上蟑螂药。弄得身上起疹子，跟那些不信教的人一样缠人……不过还算没那么烦。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341514
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341515
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341516
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 看吧，看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341517
    m_Localized: 'Nun: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341518
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 哪儿不对劲么？不过是这么多年的苦日子，给我留下的印记罢了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341519
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 哪儿不对劲么？不过是疲倦留下的印记罢了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341520
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 孩子，你要是知道我这双眼睛见过多少罪孽就好了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341521
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341522
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341523
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 你是不是疯了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341524
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 竟然逼一个体弱多病的老妇人抬起手来，露出身体部位……给你这种人看！想想都恶心！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341525
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 休想！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341526
    m_Localized: 'Nun: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341527
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 太下流了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341528
    m_Localized: 'Nun: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341529
    m_Localized: 'Nun: ……我看你是不会让我清净了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341530
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 这一切如果是祂的旨意……那就顺其自然吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341531
    m_Localized: 'Nun: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341532
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341533
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341534
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 拍照？呸！我才没空陪你胡闹！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341535
    m_Localized: 'Nun: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341536
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 你真以为照片能揭示真相？愿上帝与我同在……我修道院里的鸽子都比你有脑子！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341537
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341538
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341539
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 想看我耳朵？！好大胆子！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341540
    m_Localized: 'Nun: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341541
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 我可不是乡下集市里挂着奖牌的牛！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341542
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 你真是脸都不要了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341543
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 这么吓唬个可怜的老妇人，难道就不觉得羞耻吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341544
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341545
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341546
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 你真以为拿枪指着我，我就会跟你忏悔吗？子弹也洗刷不掉你的罪孽，孩子。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341547
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341548
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341549
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 孩子，我在你眼中看不到上帝，这比人类的什么武器都要吓人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341550
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341551
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341552
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 上帝全看在眼里！你是怎么折磨可怜的老妇人的，祂看得清清楚楚……你就不觉得羞愧吗！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341553
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341554
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341555
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 荒谬！你真觉得杀了我就能赎罪？天呐，你是不是一直都这么蠢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341556
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 蠢到让人愚弄也不在意？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341557
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341558
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341559
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 孩子，我亲眼见过的恐怖景象，能让你的灵魂化为灰烬。你在上帝看来，不过是在挥舞着小玩意罢了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341560
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 迷途的羔羊，遵循了最新消息的指引……结果却对同胞捅刀子，比灾难还要残忍。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341561
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341562
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341563
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 你活到我这个年纪还一颗牙都不掉试试！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341564
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 孩子，你成天吃这么些垃圾，牙齿比我先掉光！……上帝保佑，前提是我们那时候都还活着。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341565
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 人家都说一个人过的是什么日子，看手就能看出来。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341566
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 我过的是什么日子？不是吃苦，就是受罪……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341567
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 眼睛是心灵的窗户。唉，孩子……可我在你这双眼睛里，只看见一片黑暗。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341568
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 你就跟那群把我赶出神圣庇护所的渎神之人一样，失去了真正的信仰之光。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341569
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 你的目光中既无信仰，也无天恩，愿你眼中永恒的黑暗惩罚你。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341570
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 你用尽手段检查了个遍，但真相不在外面，在里面。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341571
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 天上的圣父啊，引导你的仆人重返光明吧。他迷途已久，深陷权力的蛊惑……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341572
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 你拍的照片全是假的！毫无意义！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341573
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 人死了，所有物还留在世间，但葬礼过后，再也不会有人看上一眼！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341574
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 留下的所有物成了遗产，你终将被遗忘。可你还站在这儿，嘴巴一张一合，跟个蠢货一样。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341575
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 主仁慈地赐我敏锐的听觉……可我却沦落到了这儿，跟个蠢货待在一起，他喜欢……喜欢……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341576
    m_Localized: 'Nun: ……天知道什么玩意儿！拿着把破枪挥来挥去，好像全世界都得听你的似的！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341577
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 天父啊，请宽恕我……我祈求不要再看见，比人还残忍的东西了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341578
    m_Localized: 'Nun: 仁慈的主啊……请接纳我的……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931020341579
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 看吧。我没什么好藏的……要说有，也就是这一身的霉运了，哈！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535552
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535553
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535554
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535555
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535556
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535557
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535558
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 行，看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535559
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535560
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 难闻吧？那群猪猡会给人做清洁，但清的不是牙齿，你懂我什么意思吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535561
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535562
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535563
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 看吧。伤肯定是不少。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535564
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535565
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 脏吧？徒手爬了带刺铁丝网，躲那群猪猡的时候又跌进水坑里，不脏就怪了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535566
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 要看就看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535567
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535568
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 脏吧？躲那群猪猡的时候跌进了水坑里，不脏就怪了。不过你说的不是手上的泥巴，对吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535569
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535570
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535571
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 好吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535572
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535573
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 你看了哪个混账一眼，人家觉得你眼神不对，抬手就是一枪。吃了枪子儿就知道不该乱瞟了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535574
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535575
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535576
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 靠……你不是耍我吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535577
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535578
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 不打理就越长越多。可我上哪儿找人给我刮？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535579
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 我忙着逃命，累得要死，肚子还挨了一枪，刮腋毛怎么看都不是要紧事，你说是吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535580
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535581
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535582
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 拍照？没想到现在还有人拍照。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535583
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535584
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 我从来不喜欢拍照。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535585
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 好了么……拍得怎么样？不对……你是不是打算跟应急中心举报我？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535586
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535587
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535588
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 有没有搞错？你就不觉得这什么伪人才有的特征会引起更多恐慌么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535589
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535590
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 脏么？干了那么久的活儿，澡都没得洗，换谁都干净不到哪儿去。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535591
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 你觉得光看耳朵就能看出来是不是伪人？没开玩笑吧你？行，想看看个够。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535592
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535593
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 够邋遢吧？信不信由你，反正应急中心的号子里没热水洗澡，也没有棉签。住宿条件够烂的，是吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535594
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535595
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535596
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 别干傻事行么？我吃过子弹，不想吃第二颗了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535597
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535598
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535599
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 看我手不爽就要杀我，你把城里的人全杀了得了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535600
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 嫌我手脏就要杀我，你把城里的人全杀了得了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535601
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535602
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535603
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 我见过不知道多少疯子、狂人，还有纯粹的怪人，你跟他们比也没好到哪儿去！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535604
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 你起码没拿他们做实验……谢谢你全家了，白痴！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535605
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535606
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535607
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 我说，你让我干的傻事我也干了，还想要我怎么样？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535608
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535609
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535610
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 什么？你想拿这张照片当我留在世上的最后一样东西？我可谢谢你了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535611
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535612
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535613
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 让我喘口气，我保准弄干净耳朵！没必要拿枪指着我！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535614
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535615
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535616
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 应急中心的号子里一块镜子都没有。没必要看自己是怎么从人变成牲口的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535617
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 靠，你让我想起那群穿黄衣服的猪猡了。有一点不对劲，抬手就是一枪。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535618
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 你跟我掏枪，我说算也就算了，换了别人……搞不好会生气，你就真得吃子弹了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535619
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 应急中心的猪猡从来不看别人眼睛，不看抓的人的眼睛，也不看同事的眼睛。你想没想过为什么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535620
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 号子里有个可怜虫，身上痒，一直挠，挠到……呃，挠到停为止。感觉是感染了什么真菌。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535621
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 号子里有个可怜虫，身上痒，一直挠，挠到……呃，挠到停为止。可能是太紧张了吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535622
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 应急中心的猪猡也给人拍照，一来就拍照，说是要做什么“记录”。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535623
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: ……他们哪天拿着我的照片来找人，你别跟他们说我在这儿，行吗？我不想被抓回去！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535624
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 别人说在安静的地方待久了，就会听到奇怪的声音。我们在号子里那会儿发现真是这样。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535625
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: 要命了……刚从一伙猪猡手里逃出来……就让另一个混账给毙了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535626
    m_Localized: 'Fugitive: ……去你的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535627
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 啊……好吧……跟我说一切都会好起来的就行。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535628
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535629
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535630
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535631
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535632
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535633
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535634
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 噢……真有那么烂么？呃……好吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535635
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535636
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我爸妈总说，呃，我……基因好。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535637
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我牙龈……有时候会出血，不是糖尿病，就是……压力太大了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535638
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我就没在乎过牙齿……小时候，我妈就经常提醒我睡觉之前先刷牙。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535639
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 可现在……我老忘记。我有时候就爬上床，闭上眼，希望他们能回来……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535640
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535641
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535642
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 噢……手，给你看……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535643
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535644
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 没什么特别的……应该没什么特别的吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535645
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我从来没认真想过手应该是个什么样。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535646
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 手嘛……是什么样就是什么样呗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535647
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 欸哟……我忘剪指甲了。我爸以前跟我说过要剪，可我没养成习惯。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535648
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 手指关节这个样子……也不是什么大事吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535649
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535650
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535651
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 眼睛？眼睛怎么了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535652
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535653
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 绿的，没什么问题……对吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535654
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 那什么，看着一切正常……就是最近有点刺痛感，可能是进了……沙子，或者过敏了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535655
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535656
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535657
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 啊……那好吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535658
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535659
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 从来没刮过。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535660
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 爸妈也没跟我说要刮，我就……也没想过要刮。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535661
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535662
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535663
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535664
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 拍照？嗯……行，拍就拍吧。就是……拍完了跟我说声没什么问题，好吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535665
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535666
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 真奇怪。你是用的什么特殊照相机拍的么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535667
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535668
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535669
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 啊？行吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535670
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535671
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 都不知道你看我耳朵是想看到什么……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535672
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535673
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535674
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 喂……别这样！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535675
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 有人揪头发，有人啃指甲……我猜我是爱剔牙，不过……也不是什么大事，对不对？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535676
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 那个……我知道我牙齿不怎么好看，但是……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535677
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 也不算符合伪人的特征……你说是吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535678
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535679
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535680
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 不是吧……我的手没什么不对劲的吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535681
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 别开枪……我是人类！只是……有点儿紧张。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535682
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535683
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535684
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 别开枪！我就是……有点儿紧张而已！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535685
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 别开枪！我就是没睡好而已！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535686
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535687
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535688
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 不会吧……你不是来真的吧？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535689
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535690
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535691
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 求你了……别这样……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535692
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535693
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535694
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 等等……耳朵什么样真这么要紧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535695
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535696
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535697
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我是喝母乳长大的，我妈还开玩笑说，我把她的钙都吸光了，她的牙齿才会比我的烂。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535698
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我这口牙……还挺漂亮的吧！就是牙龈不太好……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535699
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我爸妈在这儿，是不是就不会这样了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535700
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 他们提醒我刷牙洗脸……我就不会变成现在这样……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535701
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: ……但他们不见了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535702
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 只剩我一个人……就变成了这样。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535703
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我有时候看着这双手，想着……妈妈说我的手指长得跟她的一样，又长又灵巧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535704
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 爸爸哈哈大笑，说我遗传到了他的拳头，劲儿大，跟他年轻的时候一样。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535705
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 可我现在再看……真不知道他们为什么这么说。我想不起他们的手长什么样了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535706
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 指关节一碰就疼。我知道不该这样，但是……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535707
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我一个人在家……等他们回来……等了好久也没人来……我也不知道该做什么。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535708
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我有时候会攥紧拳头捶墙，反正总比干坐着要好。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535709
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 你也不能说我什么，是吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535710
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 妈妈跟我说话，总是先看我一边的眼睛，再看另一边的眼睛，就这么来回扫一下，快得很！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535711
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 爸爸他……总是找准一边的眼睛，盯着不放。我在想……他现在人在这儿，会盯着我哪边的眼睛？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535712
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 你说得对……我老是哭。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535713
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 可屋里就你一个人，打电话没人接，爸爸妈妈就这么……人间蒸发了，换了你，你能不哭么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535714
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我也不想哭，真的……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535715
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我也不知道……怎么面对孤独。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535716
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我总觉得照爸妈说的做，就不会有事。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535717
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 叫我洗脸，我就洗脸，叫我别插嘴，我就不插嘴。没什么问题，对吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535718
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 但是现在……没人告诉我怎么做了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535719
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 那……我不是得自己做决定了么？我要是选错了怎么办……？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535720
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我知道有人会觉得奇怪，但是……我一直都对外表很无所谓。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535721
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我爸妈说我是个帅哥，我觉得这就够了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535722
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 他们不在……我也就……不在乎这个了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535723
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我不喜欢这张照片，不知道哪儿不对劲，反正看着……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535724
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 像有什么东西压在我身上。这是正常的吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535725
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 照片上的光环有什么含义么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535726
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我真不知道……以前没见过这种东西。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535727
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 但是我的光环跟我爸妈的不一样……是不是说明我不是原来那个我了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535728
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我可能变了，他们认不出我来了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535729
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我等了好长时间，希望能听见敲门声。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535730
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 希望能听见他们的声音，还有熟悉的脚步声……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535731
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: ……但我什么都没听见。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535732
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 时间一点点流逝，我觉得……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535733
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 自己好像也不存在了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535734
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 我觉得我又毁了一切。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535735
    m_Localized: 'Bestson: 对不起，妈妈……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535736
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 检查我？行啊，朋友。我没藏着啥，也没必要藏。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535737
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535738
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535739
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535740
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535741
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535742
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535743
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 嗯，看吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535744
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535745
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 看见没？一半亮堂堂，干干净净，好得不能再好，其余的么……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535746
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 这么说吧，保养得没那么好。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535747
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 生活嘛，朋友……哪会总对你客气。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535748
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535749
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535750
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 看吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535751
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535752
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 够大的吧？生来就是揉面团、造房子的料……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535753
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 结果呢，光会开酒瓶子、砸东西了。人生嘛，就是这么回事。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535754
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 结果呢，光会开酒瓶子了。人生嘛，就是这么回事。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535755
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535756
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535757
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 行，看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535758
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535759
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 棕色的，普普通通，世界上有一半的人眼睛都是这个颜色，没啥稀奇的，朋友。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535760
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535761
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535762
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 呃……确定要看？那看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535763
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535764
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 没啥好看的。全是毛，密得很，还长了点儿真菌。多半是跟狗一起睡觉染上的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535765
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535766
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535767
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 行，想拍就拍吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535768
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535769
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 说实话，没拍过几张照片，一直没腾出空来。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535770
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535771
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535772
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 瞧见没……普普通通一耳朵，没啥稀罕的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535773
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535774
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 没啥稀奇的，是吧？想摸就摸摸看。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535775
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535776
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535777
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 就因为我这一口牙……？朋友，我没那个意思，不过你为这个就杀人，也太彪了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535778
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535779
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535780
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 唉，朋友……我真想相信人死了，不是就这么完了，我说不定还能在哪个地方，再见到我的好姑娘。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535781
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535782
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535783
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 哎哟，朋友……心肝宝贝不在了，谁日子能好过？流几滴眼泪也是人之常情。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535784
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 怎么？人有心，会哭，你就要开枪杀人？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535785
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 那……朋友，要开别照着眼睛开，行不？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535786
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 临死之前能看见点儿美好的东西也不错。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535787
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535788
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535789
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 真菌这事，我肯定会去看医生的……可看了有什么意义？尤其是都这时候了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535790
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535791
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535792
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 欸，起码给我看一眼拍成什么样了，也不会坏到哪儿去吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535793
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535794
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535795
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 开玩笑吧朋友？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535796
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535797
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535798
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 以前有个牙医说我牙齿长成这样，可以去拍电视广告了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535799
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 然后……哈！……他们当天晚上出局了，就因为我笑了一下，好笑吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535800
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 我都没跟人吵起来，就是……不该笑的时候笑了一下。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535801
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 她还活着那会儿……我就是用这双手抱着，轻轻摸她的……她的毛真的很软。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535802
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 朋友，你都不知道，我想她想得要命。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535803
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 奶奶跟我说：“你这么看着我，好像已经在跟我道别了。”'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535804
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 我那会儿还不明白她什么意思。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535805
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 现……现在我明白了，她说得对，可我没机会亲口告诉她了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535806
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 我那天晚上……跟她靠在一起。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535807
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 心想着，这样没准能让她暖和暖和……我猜，我是想让她舒服点儿，她是想给我留下点儿纪念。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535808
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 是不是很荒唐？她不在了……我还把她带在身边。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535809
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 我以前给狗拍了好多照片，太喜欢了，怎么都拍不够。想拿照片给大家看看，好好炫耀炫耀。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535810
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 但是让我拍自己？不想拍。尤其是要登校刊上的照片，上面的人莫名其妙打扮得很花哨……我干不来这种事。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535811
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 有一次，附近有人放烟花，小狗吓得浑身发抖……拼了命往我这儿钻。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535812
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 唉，可怜呀……我抱起她，努力哄着，让她别害怕。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535813
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 我就想啊……“欸，有人能这么哄我就好了。我害怕的时候，也想有谁这么陪着我，告诉我我不是一个人。”'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535814
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 就是这样了么……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535815
    m_Localized: 'Buddy: 朋友……？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535816
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 你认真的？要检查我这个议员？呸……行啊，那你可看仔细了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535817
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535818
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535819
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535820
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535821
    m_Localized: 照片
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535822
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535823
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 接下来是不是要老子弯腰撅屁股？真够可笑的，浪费议员时间搞这种破事。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535824
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535825
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 你还真没完没了是吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535826
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 啧。行，看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535827
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535828
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 所以？看爽了没？呸……告诉你，抽烟不光能定神，还能试出人品。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535829
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 有人抽一口就怂了。我？我他妈抽了一辈子，没骗你。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535830
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535831
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535832
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 仔细看看……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535833
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535834
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 看好了。美好年代的纪念品。这双手端过酒杯，夹过雪茄，还，咳，撑起过整个国家。现在呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535835
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 现在光是不抖就耗尽全力了。连这都得看运气，懂么！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535836
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535837
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535838
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 行了行了，等会儿……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535839
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535840
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 所以？看出什么了？以为我是个酒鬼？扯淡。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535841
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 所以？看出什么了？以为我是个酒鬼？扯淡。只不过没酒的人生实，'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535842
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: ……啊，去他的。这下满意了吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535843
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535844
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535845
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 哼。你们这检查可真够怪的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535846
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535847
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 别吓尿裤子，我死不了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535848
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 哈。知道吗，有人说腋毛代表，咳，男子气概。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535849
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 我的气概够三个男人用。可真要用的时候都他妈去哪了？哈！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535850
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 这世道变得真他妈荒唐……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535851
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535852
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535853
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 继续啊。先让我站起来……就像当年那样……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535854
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535855
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 怎么样！看着还行吗？还是那个老样子吧？哈哈！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535856
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535857
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535858
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 那儿没什么好看的……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535859
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535860
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 瞧瞧，议员的耳朵。什么没听过。窃窃私语……还有，咳，惨叫……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535861
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535862
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535863
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 好啊，好啊。开枪啊。让我看看你怎么心安理得地活下去。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535864
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535865
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535866
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 唉，都赖压力太大……压力大到老子把烟都揉碎了。自那以后也懒得再抠指甲缝里的泥了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535867
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 怎么，这在你家也算犯罪？嗯？说话啊？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535868
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 看这双手的样子，我早就算个死人了。赶紧的……给个痛快。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535869
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535870
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535871
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 行啊，来呗。呸……！这鬼日子怎么收场老子早就不在乎了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535872
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535873
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535874
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 呸……腋下有啥大不了！告诉你，这年头谁还没点毛病！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535875
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 来啊，扣扳机。屁用都没有。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535876
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535877
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535878
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 如果这张照片就是我的罪证，行。我以前也决定过别人的命运，最好能给个痛快的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535879
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535880
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535881
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 你开玩笑呢吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535882
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535883
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535884
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 牙医跟我说过“再不戒烟，牙齿会掉光”，我直接吼回去“你他妈知道老子是谁吗？！”'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535885
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 现在照镜子想想……或许那些压力真不值。哈！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535886
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 曾经，我只要签下自己的大名，就能决定他人的命运。现在？看着如今生不如死的自己，我只希望有人能决定我的命运。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535887
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 怎么总能想出这种鬼点子？先是死死地盯着对方，然后冷不防地掏出枪来。搞什么鬼？简直荒唐至极！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535888
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 我的眼睛曾经碧绿如洗，既清澈又明亮。现在？已经……变得浑浊不清了。生活给它们蒙上了一层灰尘，我已经懒擦掉了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535889
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 你根本就不知道我一天要流多少汗！而且，还总抽不出空去看医生。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535890
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 于是，就变成现在的这个鬼样子了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535891
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 我还年轻的时候，认识一个有着……咳，同样恩赐的家伙。他管这叫“参孙的头发”。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535892
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 不久之后，这个家伙……陷入了绝境。结果，这些被他奉为圭臬的腋毛并没有能拯救自己的性命。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535893
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 你知道吗？曾经有过那么几次……针对我的肃清行动。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535894
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 烧掉我的照片、销毁我的文件，甚至还试过置我于死地。然而，到头来……又有什么用呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535895
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 内心残留的印记仍然无法抹去……人们依旧记得这个能决定自己命运的家伙，也就是本人。世事本就如此。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535896
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 有时……我们需要的只是片刻的安宁。然而，却永远都无法触及。就连没人说话的时候……脑海里还是会响起杂音。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535897
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 地狱再惨……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535898
    m_Localized: 'Fatman: 也不过如此……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535899
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 随便检查。但你知道……什么都没用。一切都是暂时的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535900
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535901
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535902
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535903
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535904
    m_Localized: 照片
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535905
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535906
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 对了……它们，是最后的见证者。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535907
    m_Localized: 'Blind: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535908
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 我咀嚼着真相，而后一吞而下。结果……被其呛得喘不过气来，直至上颚紧紧地抵住我的喉咙。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535909
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 当目光扫过它的时候，我不由自主地握紧了拳头,因太过用力而感到疼痛。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535910
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 如今，我的双手之中徒余空虚……只能静静地等待死亡的到来，帮我忘却一切。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535911
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535912
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535913
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 还会动吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535914
    m_Localized: 'Blind: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535915
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 好、好，它尚未夺去我的一切。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535916
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 然而，后来……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535917
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 我疯狂吞咽、放声尖叫、不停呕吐，把自己撕扯得体无完肤。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535918
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 头颅裂成两半，脑浆透过墙壁不断地、缓缓地流出。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535919
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 墙壁，墙壁、大门、窗户……它就在那里。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535920
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535921
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535922
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 哈哈哈哈哈……好吧，没什么特别的，随你看个够吧！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535923
    m_Localized: 'Blind: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535924
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 它喜欢受到瞩目。我……无法描述，难以形容。它实在太过吓人，早就已经远远超出凡人的心智所能承受的极限。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535925
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535926
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535927
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 真有……意思。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535928
    m_Localized: 'Blind: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535929
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 你知道……那黏腻的阴影，会先笼罩住什么吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535930
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 不知道？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535931
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 我现在知道了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535932
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535933
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535934
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 好的……随你高兴。开启闪光灯也无所谓，我不在乎。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535935
    m_Localized: 'Blind: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535936
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 而且，甚至也不需要向我展示拍得怎样。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535937
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535938
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535939
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 听到了吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535940
    m_Localized: 'Blind: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535941
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 寂静之声……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535942
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535943
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535944
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 寻常武器无法抵御……那个家伙。我甚至不确定到底有没有方法可以对付它。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535945
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535946
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535947
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 于梦中，我几乎可以触碰到它……感受它的形体，重量……然而，它……便会突然消失不见，徒留满心的恐惧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535948
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535949
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535950
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 你的目光会不由自主地被它吸引过去，无法移开……除非，你把自己的双眼给完完全全地挖出来。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535951
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535952
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535953
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 我浑身上下的每一寸肌肤都在发麻，就好像是在催促我赶紧去抓挠、甚至是把整张皮被剥下来……实在是难以忍受。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535954
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535955
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535956
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 我以前对拍照颇有研究，对每处细节都非常用心……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535957
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 至于，现在……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535958
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535959
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535960
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 要是你也听过它移动时所发出的声音的话……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535961
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 要是你也听过它的脚步和自己的脚步纠缠在一起时所发出的声音的话……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535962
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 要是你也听过它在嗅闻你的气息时空气因颤抖所发出的声音的话……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535963
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535964
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535965
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 你是否曾经听过这样的一种声音……明明正在咀嚼，却不是在进食？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535966
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 就好像在贪婪地品尝着你的气息、你的声音，以及你颤抖的模样？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535967
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 它，就会发出这种声音。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535968
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 与此同时，还不断地等待着……耐心地等待着，等待着我也发出同样的声音。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535969
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 然后，就会突然传来一阵激疼、令我惊醒，全身上下早已被汗水浸透。我下意识地用双手捂住嘴巴，想要抑制住即将爆发的尖叫。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535970
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 它并不畏惧他人的注视，反而甘之若饴。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535971
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 它会在我们的瞳孔之中扎根。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535972
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 它会在我们的眼睑之下微微震颤。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535973
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 它……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535974
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 抱歉……我感到不太舒服……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535975
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 当它徐徐爬来……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535976
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 当它滑过躯体、钻进骨头……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535977
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 只需一次触碰，你就会感觉到，它已经存在于皮肤之下。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535978
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 然后……你的皮囊，将不再属于你。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535979
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 而你……也似乎不再属于自己……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535980
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 此等痛苦，极其真切、难以忍受……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535981
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 要是……要是那个东西找上了你的话……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535982
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 无论如何，都千万、千万不要给它拍照。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535983
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 因为，这样做只会为它提供养分……令它变得更强，使它能更轻松地掌控我们这些凡人！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535984
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 我听到了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535985
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 不是在看见它的时候。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535986
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 而是在这之前。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535987
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 在它出现之前。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535988
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 一阵轻微的摩擦声。就好像有人在十步之外跟着自己一样……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535989
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 接着，缩短到了五步……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535990
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 然后，只要转过头去，就会……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535991
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 抱歉。我想，我还是……就此打住为好。相信我，你并不会想要知道接下来发生的事情。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535992
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 它来了它来了它来了它来了它来了它来了它来了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535993
    m_Localized: 'Blind: 它……来了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535994
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 伙计放心，真没事儿～咱随便唠，别整那些客套的，我受不了~'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535995
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535996
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535997
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535998
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024535999
    m_Localized: 照片
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536000
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536001
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 哈哈哈哈走着兄弟！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536002
    m_Localized: 'Dude: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536003
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 这牙看着像啃苞米长大的不像吃细粮的哈？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536004
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 但结实着呢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536005
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 有回开啤酒瓶差点把舌头咬穿，酒反正是喝着了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536006
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 纯属烟抽多了，懂的都懂。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536007
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536008
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536009
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 兄弟，我前两天找存货来着，指甲缝里泥多了点别介意。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536010
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 哎哎哎，'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536011
    m_Localized: 'Dude: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536012
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 哈哈，有回嗑嗨了盯自己手指头看，突然发现这是我自己的手指。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536013
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 就这么动两下瞅半天……贼魔幻。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536014
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536015
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536016
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 眼睛不能瞪太久，眼皮耷拉，难受。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536017
    m_Localized: 'Dude: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536018
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 瞳孔放大是吧？哈哈，习惯了，便利店为这个抓过我多少回你知道不。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536019
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 眼睛血红是吧？哈哈，习惯了，他们为这个抓过我多少回你知道不。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536020
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 欸，我得给你说个事，巨离谱。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536021
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536022
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536023
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 等下啊，兄弟……我先脱个衣服。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536024
    m_Localized: 'Dude: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536025
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 老痒了，都说我不洗衣服，但这玩意儿是天生的对吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536026
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 刮得光溜，像婴儿……呃，差不多吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536027
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 兄弟，你说实话，腋毛这玩意儿到底有啥用？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536028
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 这都啥年代了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536029
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 又不防虫又不保暖的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536030
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536031
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536032
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 必须的，兄弟！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536033
    m_Localized: 'Dude: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536034
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 所以磁场咋样？旺不旺？哈哈我就知道。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536035
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536036
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536037
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 嗯哼。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536038
    m_Localized: 'Dude: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536039
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 为啥耷拉着？以前打过钉……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536040
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536041
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536042
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 别啊兄弟！再陪我聊会儿呗！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536043
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536044
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536045
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 玩这么猛？等等，你是不是觉得枪就像自己长身上的感觉？牛逼！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536046
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536047
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536048
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 别别别，刚才那段多带劲啊！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536049
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536050
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536051
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 说不定人家就该长那样呢？说不定那样对身体好，反而是咱们脱离自然了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536052
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 你不剃也没事啊，自己开心就行，我就随便说说！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536053
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536054
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536055
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 兄弟，我现在上头得厉害，你真是扫了我的兴。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536056
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536057
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536058
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 想不想听为啥搞成这样？老带劲了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536059
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536060
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536061
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 兄弟，我以前觉得牙齿就那样呗，有就有呗，挺酷的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536062
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 后来有个兄弟说，你这是骨头啊！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536063
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 想想看，你嘴里戳出来一堆骨头！吓死个人，我那阵子都不敢张嘴。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536064
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 我手指头长得也太怪了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536065
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 手指天天用，但嗑嗨前根本没琢磨过这玩意儿是啥……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536066
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 自打那回之后，越看越觉得吓人！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536067
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 你盯着手就开始想：这要不是我的呢？纯属抽大了，难受了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536068
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 眼睛大就是萌，有点儿像那部动画电影……就是绿皮沼泽怪物和穿靴子的猫那种样子的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536069
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 妹子也吃这套，哈哈！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536070
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 有回我飘着……压马路。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536071
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 心想条子要拦我就问是不是嗨了，我就说“没啊我一直这样”。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536072
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 结果真被拦了！人问“眼睛红啥？一直这样？”，我说“没，就是嗑嗨了”。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536073
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 兄弟，你天天这样试试，换你你也得痒。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536074
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 说真的，谁真喜欢长毛啊？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536075
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 腋下屁股……净碍事儿。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536076
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 穿衣服还留这玩意儿干啥，我是没懂。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536077
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 有时候真能感觉到磁场真的……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536078
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 就像身边绕着一圈看不见的东西。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536079
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 嗑大发了……啊不是，累大发了，就有点瘆人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536080
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 平时还挺得劲的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536081
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 以前有个巨帅的耳钉，带瞳孔花纹的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536082
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 弄丢后总觉得缺了一块。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536083
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 别人看是耳朵，我看是个洞。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536084
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 还以为咱俩处挺好呢……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536085
    m_Localized: 'Dude: 兄弟……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536086
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 明白了……想看就看吧，我没什么好藏的……早就什么都不剩了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536087
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536088
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536089
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536090
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536091
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536092
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536093
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 看见没？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536094
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536095
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 白得……几乎完美。只是……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536096
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 他们把我绑在柱子上后，殴打了我，强迫我眼睁睁地看着悲剧的发生……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536097
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536098
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536099
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 来吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536100
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536101
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 我……我试图将大门打开、把窗户砸破，然而……火势实在是蔓延得……太快了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536102
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536103
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536104
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 看吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536105
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536106
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 我……亲眼目睹了一切的发生。火势不断逼近，孩子彼此相拥……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536107
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 目光四处游移、寻找我的身影，希望我能救大家逃出生天……实在是难以忍受。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536108
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 即使是现在，我也还是不敢闭上双眼、害怕会再次见到他们的脸庞……无助，焦黑，因痛苦而扭曲……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536109
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536110
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536111
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 蛤？你……确定真的有必要这样做吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536112
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536113
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 我已经习惯成自然了。既然下定决心要照顾好孩子们，也就得小心、谨慎，好成为他们的榜样。教会他们该如何洗脸、刷牙……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536114
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 然而，现在……已经无人可教了。已经，一无所有了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536115
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536116
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536117
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 就随你喜欢好了。拍吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536118
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536119
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536120
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536121
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536122
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536123
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536124
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 我有段时间很喜欢戴耳环……小小的，上面镶嵌着精致的宝石。孩子们都说看起来一闪、一闪的，就跟星星一样。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536125
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 不过，之后耳朵越来越疼……于是，就给取下来了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536126
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536127
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536128
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 想要把我这个……漏网之鱼，给收拾掉？不出所料。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536129
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536130
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536131
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 怎么了，动手呀，为什么要犹豫？我的这双手……已经再也无法帮助他人了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536132
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536133
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536134
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 如果你能看到那幅早已深深地烙印在了我的脑海中的景象……只要你的内心还有哪怕一丝怜悯，肯定会毫不犹豫地扣下扳机、给我个痛快。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536135
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536136
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536137
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 开枪吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536138
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536139
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536140
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 动手吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536141
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536142
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536143
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 你觉得……凭借一颗子弹，就能终结痛苦？天啊，希望如此……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536144
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536145
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536146
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 我在教导孩子们该如何去刷牙的时候，是这样说的，”灿烂的笑容是世上最美的表情。“然后……他们一个接一个地绽开了笑脸，争先恐后地给我展示自己的小小牙齿。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536147
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 然而，现在……这宝贵的回忆，反而令我感到……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536148
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 抱歉……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536149
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 我的这双手……曾经为他们编过头发、处理过伤口，还教过他们该如何去系鞋带……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536150
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 然而，现在……一切均已失去意义。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536151
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 毕竟，自会有更为强大、更加残忍的家伙来替你决定自己的命运……既然如此，又何必白费力气呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536152
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 我一直在想……要是我能破开大门的话，就好了……要是我能找到其他路的话，就好了……现在，只要一闭上眼睛，就会再次看到当时那熊熊燃烧着的烈焰。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536153
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 我记得自己曾经这样跟孩子们说过，”只要注意卫生，就不会生病啦。“现在，我知道了……污物不算什么，病痛也不可怕，最糟糕的，永远都是人类。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536154
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 我想要记住他们的音容、笑貌……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536155
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 然而，随着时间一点、一滴地流逝，一切都逐渐地变得模糊起来……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536156
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 最后，只剩下他们因痛苦、恐惧和困惑而扭曲的脸庞……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536157
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 有时候摸着耳朵……会想起曾经有一个小女孩特别喜欢我的耳环。她说，自己长大之后也要买一对一模一样的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536158
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 但现在……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536159
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 她永远……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536160
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 对不起……求你了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536161
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: 终于……要结束了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931024536162
    m_Localized: 'Teacher: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729856
    m_Localized: 'Wheelchair: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729857
    m_Localized: 'Wheelchair: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729858
    m_Localized: 'Wheelchair: 行吧。怎么，有事？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729859
    m_Localized: 'Wheelchair: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729860
    m_Localized: 'Wheelchair: 要是……连你都不信这些特征，我凭什么信？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729861
    m_Localized: 'Wheelchair: 说不定这些特征都是伪人编的呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729862
    m_Localized: 'Wheelchair: 人当然会犯错'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729863
    m_Localized: 'Wheelchair: 但有些错误……代价太沉重了'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729864
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 想检查一下我？哈哈。好啊，来吧。起码，能搞清楚……什么事情。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729865
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729866
    m_Localized: 双手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729867
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729868
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729869
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729870
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729871
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 牙齿？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729872
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 你会把被良心抛下的东西通通都给放进嘴里、细细咀嚼吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729873
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729874
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 把它们全都给吞下肚子里。甚至，还会，在良心上面咬出一个大洞。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729875
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 归根到底……良心到底是什么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729876
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729877
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729878
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 你这是在打什么主意？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729879
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 我是舞伶，靠自己的双腿吃饭。你反而要看我的双手？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729880
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729881
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 猫咪把我的手给……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729882
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 要不是因为他说一定得让它活着的话，我早就已经……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729883
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 不光把我的手给抓得血肉模糊，还总是令我感到困扰、不愉快。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729884
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729885
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729886
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 哎呀，终于来到有趣的部分了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729887
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 你知道……这双瞳孔里反映着什么吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729888
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729889
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 悲剧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729890
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 而你，早已置身其中。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729891
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 好了，感觉如何？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729892
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729893
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729894
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 哈哈哈哈！来吧，仔细看看，好好闻闻。你还想怎么样？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729895
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729896
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 如何，还喜欢吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729897
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729898
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729899
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 嗯……这我可不知道。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729900
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 就来看看好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729901
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729902
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 呼。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729903
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729904
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 没人跟我说过这个。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729905
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 难道，是因为跳舞的关系？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729906
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 如果我是你，肯定会被吓到的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729907
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729908
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729909
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 哎呀，是个不错的兆头。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729910
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729911
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 好了，结果如何？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729912
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 谁是好人，谁是坏人？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729913
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729914
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729915
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 哈哈哈，来吧，动手！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729916
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729917
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729918
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 你……想要见血吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729919
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 我也是。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729920
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 不过，遗憾的是，我并没有……起码，现在如此。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729921
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729922
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729923
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 你……不喜欢血？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729924
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 然而，这栋房子里却每天都会发生流血事件。我还以为……你对此颇为狂热呢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729925
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 我应该没说错吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729926
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729927
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729928
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 怎么，想再闻一遍？想得美。你自己没有好好把握机会。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729929
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 与我无关。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729930
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 会做这种事的……多半是个白痴。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729931
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729932
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729933
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 要起舞了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729934
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 随你喜欢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729935
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729936
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729937
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 你是怎么得出这个结论的？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729938
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 单凭耳朵？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729939
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729940
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729941
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 为什么改变主意？怎么，难道……是想检查其他的地方？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729942
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 是想发现更多的特征？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729943
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 为什么把枪举起，然后又放下来？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729944
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 无法下定决心？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729945
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 照我看来，蠢到家了，哈哈哈哈。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729946
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 我们都渴望鲜血。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729947
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 为什么你如此笃定，自己并不是伪人？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729948
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 你也一样，只不过是想铺出一条能确实通往死亡的道路罢了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729949
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: ……愚蠢至极！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729950
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 怎么……就因为这支舞，闹起脾气来了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729951
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 或许……你听到了不一样的旋律，一首我们唱了很久、很久的曲子。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729952
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 是吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729953
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 你知道……接下来，会有什么在等待自己吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729954
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 照我看来，你就像游乐园里的小丑，待在这栋随时都有可能分崩离析的房子里，脸上一整天都挂着傻笑。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729955
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 还真省事。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729956
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 耳朵……嘻嘻。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729957
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 耳朵、耳朵、耳朵、耳朵。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729958
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 这……正是它想要的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729959
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 没想到它偏爱的人，竟会是你这种白痴。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729960
    m_Localized: 'Ballerina: 没想到……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729961
    m_Localized: 'Mother: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729962
    m_Localized: 'Mother: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729963
    m_Localized: 'Anger: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729964
    m_Localized: 'Anger: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729965
    m_Localized: 'Anger: 悠着点抡你那烧火棍'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729966
    m_Localized: 'Anger: 等下老子耳朵没查完、脑袋先开瓢'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729967
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 噢当然当然～请别叨扰我家亲爱的，她可累坏了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729968
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729969
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729970
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729971
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729972
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729973
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729974
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 为了保护自己心爱的人，有时，不得不狠狠地咬住生活，绝不放松。哈哈。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729975
    m_Localized: 'Couple: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729976
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 你也知道，现在的日子很不好过。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729977
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 我的牙齿并不好看，不过，我也不能怎样。上学那会儿，还有人笑我牙齿长得不好呢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729978
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 不知道那些欺负人的人现在怎么样了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729979
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 大概，已经烂在哪条巷子里面了吧……让哪个跟当年的自己一样的怪物活活打死。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729980
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729981
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729982
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 我和我的妻子都很注重个人卫生，不会有什么问题的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729983
    m_Localized: 'Couple: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729984
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 说实话……面对如此世道，反而更应保持清洁、干净。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729985
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 你想，要是生病了的话，又有谁能伸出援手呢？根本没有，对吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729986
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 也许，正因如此……伪人才会比我们更加强大？毕竟，它们根本就不会生病。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729987
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 也许，正因如此……伪人才会是伪人？毕竟，它们根本就不会生病。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729988
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729989
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729990
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 没问题，来看看我的吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729991
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 只是，稍微有点紧张。不过，也是人之常情，对吧？毕竟，这一系列的检查着实有点吓人。虽然，我也知道你并没有什么好隐瞒的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729992
    m_Localized: 'Couple: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729993
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 好吧，唉……我不是有点紧张，而是非常紧张。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729994
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 毕竟要撑起两个人的生活，这，也是在所难免的，对吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729995
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729996
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729997
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 不、不，只检查我的就好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729998
    m_Localized: 'Couple: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028729999
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 女性可以剃毛，我又为什么不行呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730000
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 现在气温这么高，这样……起码可以在一定程度上调节一下自己的体温。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730001
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 你应该也这么认为吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730002
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 只有女性才会在意腋毛，想剃掉。我为什么要剃？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730003
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 毕竟，我还有更为重要的职责，那就是在这个怪物横行的世界里保护好她。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730004
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730005
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730006
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 等等，这也是一项检查？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730007
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 不行，既不能拍我，也不能拍她。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730008
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 不过……要是这样的话，你会怀疑我们。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730009
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 让我想想。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730010
    m_Localized: 'Couple: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730011
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 好吧，拍吧。不过，之后会把照片给我的，对吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730012
    m_Localized: 'Couple: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730013
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 之后会把照片给我的……对吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730014
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730015
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730016
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 我实在是看不出来这究竟与伪人有什么联系。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730017
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 不过，好吧，随你高兴。我也没有什么好东西隐瞒的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730018
    m_Localized: 'Couple: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730019
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 如何，看到什么了吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730020
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 宝贝，你有听说过与耳朵相关的特征……之类的事情吗？怎么一句话也不说？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730021
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 真的假的？好吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730022
    m_Localized: 'Couple: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730023
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 真有意思。好了，结果如何？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730024
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730025
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730026
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 拜托，要是离开了我的话，我的爱人活不下去。把枪放下吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730027
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730028
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730029
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 然后，又该怎样呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730030
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 这不会对我有帮助。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730031
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 也不会对你有帮助。为什么还要掏枪？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730032
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 也不会对你有帮助，先生……为什么还要掏枪？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730033
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730034
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730035
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 这样不对吧。你不能检查她，就要拿枪指着人吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730036
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 我对天发誓，她是个人类。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730037
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 我们已经收拾好了行李，不管哪天晚上都能离开。然而……她只不过是动作慢了点，错过了出发的时机罢了。即便如此，也不能说明我们就是伪人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730038
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730039
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730040
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 我相信，你应该不是什么穷凶极恶的家伙。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730041
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 难道……真的是因为腋毛？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730042
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730043
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730044
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 我答应你拍这张照片，其实……意义非常重大。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730045
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 然而，遗憾的是，看来，你并不这样认为。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730046
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730047
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730048
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 指甲？当然。毕竟，伪人是从地下爬出来的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730049
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 眼睛？我可以理解。腋下？也不是不行。只是……耳朵？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730050
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 眼睛？我可以理解。腋下？也不是不行。只是……耳朵？难道，是因为比较靠近大脑的缘故？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730051
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730052
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730053
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 希望我没有令你感到太过疲惫。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730054
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 我很清楚，如今，想要维护秩序是多么的艰难。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730055
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 譬如……我甚至都管不住自己的妻子，哈哈。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730056
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 也许，你无法理解。不过，没事，我会放在心里、绝不外传。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730057
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 时势艰难，人心惶惶。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730058
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 要是不弄脏自己的双手，试着去战斗、或是……做一些其他更加糟糕的事情的话，根本就活不下去。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730059
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 每当想到她说不定会遭遇什么不测的时候，我都会……不由自主地发起抖来。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730060
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 最令我感到害怕的是，我不知道自己什么时候会耗尽仅剩的力气、再也无法保护她。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730061
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 我只好不断训练，令自己变得更强。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730062
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 哎呀，宝贝，你是不是抖了一下？没事，不要害怕。有我在呢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730063
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 我们夫妻有着各自的职责。我会保证她的安全，带她回娘家看看爸妈。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730064
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 而她，则负责满足我的一切需求。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730065
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 非常公平，对吧？希望身边的人讲卫生，这不算专制，你应该能理解吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730066
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 生活教会了我一件事，不要透露自己的身份，还有去处。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730067
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 无知是福……这话没错。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730068
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 我们只不过是想不出任何意外，平平安安地回到家里罢了，仅此而已。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730069
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 对吧，宝贝？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730070
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 我已经没有什么要说的了，我们就继续收拾行李去了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730071
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 冷静、冷静。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730072
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 拜托。难道，你真的忍心向弱女子开枪吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730073
    m_Localized: 'Couple: 你为什么会……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730074
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 行啊，老家伙。随便验。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730075
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730076
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730077
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730078
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730079
    m_Localized: 照片
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730080
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730081
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 真邪门。敢乱来老子把你脸砸烂。说到做到。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730082
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730083
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 我爹妈关心我牙都比关心我多。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730084
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730085
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730086
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730087
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 哼……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730088
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 别大惊小怪的……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730089
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730090
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 过敏而已。痒得厉害。老毛病了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730091
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730092
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730093
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730094
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730095
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730096
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 记好了。敢乱动老子戳瞎你眼。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730097
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730098
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730099
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730100
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730101
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 想都别想。这特么太变态了。不干。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730102
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730103
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730104
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730105
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 拍照片是想让我爸妈好找到我？赶紧滚。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730106
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730107
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 所以呢？给我看啊！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730108
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730109
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730110
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 行行行，随便，无所谓。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730111
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730112
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 所以？够干净了吗？符合你那套白痴标准了吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730113
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730114
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730115
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730116
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 妈的！开枪啊！我受够这破事了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730117
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 来啊！动手！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730118
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 扣扳机啊！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730119
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 怂了吗混蛋？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730120
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730121
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730122
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 老头，我跟你说，我真无所谓了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730123
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 要杀要放给个痛快。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730124
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730125
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730126
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 我眼睛好得很！你找茬是吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730127
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730128
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730129
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730130
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 疯了吧你！自己听听说的什么鬼话！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730131
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 妈的！开枪啊！我受够这破事了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730132
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 来啊！动手！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730133
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 扣扳机啊！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730134
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 怂了吗混蛋？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730135
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730136
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730137
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 然后呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730138
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 诶唷！大男人！拿着把牛逼的枪！快看我多牛逼呀！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730139
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 说真的，早就不在乎了。关我屁事。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730140
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730141
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730142
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 行，然后呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730143
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730144
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730145
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 下次直接开枪。老子不跪也不求。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730146
    m_Localized: 彻底受够了……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730147
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 我妈以前总唠叨我的手，说没个女孩样。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730148
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 过敏起疹子我能怎么办？又不是我能控制的……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730149
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 算了。无所谓了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730150
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 知道人生最重要的是什么吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730151
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730152
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 找个老公生孩子！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730153
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730154
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 超酷的对吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730155
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: ……呵，滚吧都。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730156
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 班上还有女生发誓说眼球颜色随心情变。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730157
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 眼睛长什么样也值得特地看一看？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730158
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 谁在乎啊？能看见不就行了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730159
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 你他妈真有病。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730160
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 再搞这种破事老子直接走人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730161
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 我家有本相册……以前总盯着幼儿园照片看，那会儿笑得真开心啊。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730162
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 我也不知道怎么就变了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730163
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 哦对，是给我戴了牙套之后……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730164
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 一直想不通为啥有家长给婴儿打耳洞。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730165
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 要是孩子自己根本不想要呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730166
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 凭什么替别人做决定啊……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730167
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 呵……算了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730168
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 其实以前想过自己打耳洞……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730169
    m_Localized: 'BigLebowski: 谢了啊……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730170
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 有用那就看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730171
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730172
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730173
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730174
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730175
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730176
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730177
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730178
    m_Localized: 'Luka: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730179
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 牙齿真能定义一个人吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730180
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730181
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730182
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730183
    m_Localized: 'Luka: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730184
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 经历了这么多以后，这双手什么都没变！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730185
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730186
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730187
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 当然没问题。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730188
    m_Localized: 'Luka: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730189
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 这双眼睛记得的东西太多了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730190
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730191
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730192
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 没料到连这个也要查。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730193
    m_Localized: 'Luka: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730194
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 很普通对吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730195
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730196
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730197
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 行。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730198
    m_Localized: 'Luka: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730199
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 又一件会在我死后留下的东西。要是……也有人能留下的话，就好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730200
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 又一件会在我死后留下的东西。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730201
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730202
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730203
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 虽然，我们的声音终将消失于宇宙之中。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730204
    m_Localized: 'Luka: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730205
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 不过，我依旧愿意倾听你的话语。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730206
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 好吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730207
    m_Localized: 'Luka: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730208
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 我始终愿意倾听你的话语。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730209
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730210
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730211
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 只要手上能握着枪，一切都会变得简单，对吧？没有必要倾听他人的话语，没有必要进行思考……只管扣下扳机即可。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730212
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730213
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730214
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 为了活下去、不停地奋斗，搞得满是泥泞。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730215
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 这些疹子，源自一段已然逝去的生命。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730216
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 难道……你认为拥有一双手，也是一种罪过？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730217
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730218
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730219
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 要是你无法压抑想要摧毁些什么东西的强烈冲动的话，就以自己的恐惧为目标吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730220
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730221
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730222
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 我并不想与你为敌。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730223
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730224
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730225
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 我实在是没有想到这张照片竟然宣判了我的死刑。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730226
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730227
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730228
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 难道，你想让这栋房子再次归于寂静吗？这意味着……你能听到的，就只剩下自己的心声了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730229
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730230
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730231
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 你知道吗？出于各种理由，我以前非常、非常地讨厌自己。后来，我意识到，生命并不在于修补一切，而是在于学会接受自己。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730232
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 死亡，也是同样的道理。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730233
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 你知道吗？我们的双手承载了一切。不光是欢乐，还有着痛苦。要是不向彼此伸出援手的话，我们就无法存活。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730234
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 眼睛……虽然已经看遍了欢乐、以及死亡，不过，我还是会尽量向前展望。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730235
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 气味……也是回忆的一部分。自己家里特有的味道、新鲜出炉的面包散发出来的香气、清晨露珠的芬芳，都给予了我们向前迈进的动力。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730236
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 照片不仅仅只是一张图像，而是我们想要铭记的回忆。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730237
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 你知道吗？所谓的倾听……不仅仅只是接收声音，而是要去理解他人，即使对方一句话也没说。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730238
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 要是这样对你来说比较轻松的话……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931028730239
    m_Localized: 'Luka: 就尽管扣下扳机好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924160
    m_Localized: 'FortuneTeller: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924161
    m_Localized: 'FortuneTeller: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924162
    m_Localized: 'FortuneTeller: 我曾经听到过一阵若有似无的嗡鸣，就在耳边响起……就好像是宇宙在跟我窃窃私语一样。不过，我认为应该是某种于这之上、维度更高的东西在向我传达着什么。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924163
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924164
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924165
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 要拍照？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924166
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 唔。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924167
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 有人跟你说过我跟太阳领袖握过手是吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924168
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 没错！我教过他怎么直视太阳！这故事回头跟你说。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924169
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 赶紧的！给我拍！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924170
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924171
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 拍得多美啊！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924172
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 改天来找我，给你讲我的传奇人生。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924173
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: ……听了给几个子儿就成。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924174
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 这可是为了拯救太阳能量！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924175
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924176
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924177
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 没错！生命信号直接从我耳朵接收！你怎么知道的？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924178
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924179
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 这可是经过处理的太阳光从我脑袋里涌出来！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924180
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 大脑转化能量！让我有力气干死地底下那些杂碎！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924181
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924182
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924183
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 打住吧疯子！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924184
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 太阳亲自给我降温！才不会让我在神圣光芒里烧着……闪耀着……懂吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924185
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 这是老子的啤酒磁场！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924186
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 得靠喝酒才不会被太阳烤熟。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924187
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 所以把你那凶器收起来……乖乖听我说。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924188
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924189
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924190
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 天呐！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924191
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 你又不是地底下钻出来的臭虫！装什么装？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924192
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924193
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924194
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 听着！我可教过太阳领袖吸收太阳能量的秘诀！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924195
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 当初那个瘦巴巴的小子跑来问我怎么在太阳下活下来。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924196
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 我直接告诉他：太阳根本伤不了你！但你太弱鸡……老子教你一招。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924197
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 我递给他个桶……让他回家涂黑扣头上……然后走到太阳底下。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924198
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 像这样吼，哇啊啊啊啊！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924199
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 这样桶里就能充满啤酒蒸汽！太阳能量随便吸！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924200
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 后来再没见过他……估计终于干正事去了吧！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924201
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 哈！你刚说的全是狗屁！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924202
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 耳朵根本不重要！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924203
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 你灰色的脑浆才该变成金黄色！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924204
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 说真的……都不知道你在盯什么玩意儿。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924205
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 想跟我聊天不用盯着身体零件看，人类！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924206
    m_Localized: 'Fanatic: 递罐啤酒过来就行！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924207
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 想检查什么地方？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924208
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924209
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924210
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924211
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924212
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924213
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924214
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 牙齿？行，看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924215
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924216
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 我牙怎么这么白？那我问你，你擦不擦屁股？我又不是什么野蛮人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924217
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 小时候家里人让我去牙医那儿戴牙箍，我没去。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924218
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 家里人为这事揍了我一顿，不过我最后也没去。我才不去。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924219
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924220
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924221
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 快点儿吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924222
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924223
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 我手脏很正常，我夜里都跑外面挖泥巴，找那群怪物去了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924224
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 用这个办法杀他们比较简单！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924225
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 我建议你也试试。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924226
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924227
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924228
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 我以前眼珠子是有颜色的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924229
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 不过上回跟伪人打完，就只有红血丝了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924230
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 我拿下了个伪人，他朝我扔了泥巴还是粪便什么的，刚好砸到眼睛，疼啊，疼到现在。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924231
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924232
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 哎哟，轻点儿，疼死了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924233
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 哼，过这种日子，最后只落下一对死灰死灰的眼睛。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924234
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924235
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924236
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 我会把伪人都拿下，用我这双手一个个撕碎。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924237
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 这么一来，我们的生活就能恢复平静了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924238
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924239
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924240
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 特征越多，越好分辨谁是人类，谁是伪人，对吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924241
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924242
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 我就是个普通人。不然还能是什么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924243
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924244
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924245
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 我不怎么喜欢拍照。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924246
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 闪光灯一亮，我就想起了打雷下雨，就害怕。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924247
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 反正不拍。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924248
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924249
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924250
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 嗯，那条新闻我也看了。行，看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924251
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924252
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 嗯？什么？你看见什么了？说啊。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924253
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 要能知道看耳朵是想确定什么特征就好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924254
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924255
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924256
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 等会儿……什么情况？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924257
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 我靠。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924258
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924259
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924260
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 深呼吸一下，别走了火。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924261
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 我起码每天晚上盯着窗户，防着伪人进屋里来。没了我，换你自己来干这活儿，难度可大多了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924262
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924263
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924264
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 靠，有的人没手，不能给你看指甲，怎么办？统统杀了么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924265
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 带我去家正经医院！等医生治好了，再来看我眼睛有没有问题。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924266
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 等等，什么让你怕成这样？怎么了，孩子？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924267
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 别急着下判断。一着急，就容易出错。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924268
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924269
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924270
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 冷静。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924271
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 陷入妄想只会如了那群怪物的愿。冷静点儿，行不？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924272
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924273
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924274
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 滚开，不会让你拍的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924275
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 给别人拍去，拍了看谁是伪人，抓出来杀了。让我一个人待会儿。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924276
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: ……噢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924277
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 我会忍不住缩一下。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924278
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924279
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 靠！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924280
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 就这样？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924281
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924282
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924283
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 怎么着，我是伪人？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924284
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 呵，有意思。你怎么得出这个结论的？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924285
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924286
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924287
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 我知道你压力不小。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924288
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 不过我们要杀的是伪人，不是自己人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924289
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 幸好你及时恢复了理智。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924290
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 没错！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924291
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 你今晚跟不跟我去勒死伪人？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924292
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 我们一起去找伪人吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924293
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 这就对咯。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924294
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 别乱下结论。出去打猎还这么干，会被撕成碎片。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924295
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 我有那么一瞬间，以为你真会开枪。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924296
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 什么东西惊到你了？我都不符合伪人的特征吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924297
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 还是说你只是一时惊慌？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924298
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 谢谢理解。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924299
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 什么照相，什么闪光，还有噪音，我都不喜欢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924300
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 呜，'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924301
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 不喜欢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924302
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 他们要警告民众留意伪人的新特征，起码得说说新特征具体是什么样的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924303
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 不然我抓着了个混账，想检查都不知道该检查什么地方。你有没有弄明白那特征具体是什么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924304
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 要扔我尸体记得扔在伪人的尸体旁边。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924305
    m_Localized: 'Hunter: 很吓人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924306
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924307
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924308
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 我真是伪人……那我是不是要开始杀人了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924309
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 我会不会变得很危险？还是说……我其实一直都很危险？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924310
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 说不定……说不定我已经杀了人了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924311
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924312
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 哈哈哈，这照片这样？你能想象得到么？这么说来……我真是伪人？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924313
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924314
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924315
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 为什么有这么多特征？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924316
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 我为什么每条特征都符合？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924317
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924318
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 我都不知道这到底意味着什么！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924319
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924320
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924321
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 现在是要怎么着？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924322
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 我能继续活着吗？还是说，我应该去死？你打算怎么办？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924323
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924324
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924325
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 什么是压垮你的最后一根稻草？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924326
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 你是不是要开枪了？我要死了吗？不要……我不要！天呐，太吓人了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924327
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924328
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924329
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 为什么我这辈子就没有一件事是还过得去的？？？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924330
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 为什么都跟我畸形扭曲的背一样，就是不正常？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924331
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 到底什么时候才是个头？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924332
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 我什么时候才能回到原来的生活？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924333
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 你还在等什么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924334
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 你还是……开枪吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924335
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 我死了，起码就不用天天抖个不停，担心你这回又要因为什么地方恨上我了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924336
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 要么杀了我，要么别成天吓唬我了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924337
    m_Localized: 'Anxiety: 求你了……我受够了。家里发生的事够痛苦的了，我只想好好清净一下。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924338
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924339
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924340
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 那帮穿黄色制服的，还有乱七八糟的伪人特征检查……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924341
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 都是……狗屁。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924342
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 纯粹是放狗屁。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924343
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 你不觉得我们在往地狱走么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924344
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 说是一切井然有序，都控制住了，但身边没有一个地方是不乱的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924345
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 来，拍吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924346
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924347
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 我怕的是拍完了照片以后的事。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924348
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 你知道自己要找什么，'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924349
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 要留意什么吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924350
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 不好意思，但是看你就这么埋头瞎找，我真觉得我们都完蛋了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924351
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924352
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 他们明天叫你把小孩剁了，你八成想都不想就干了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924353
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 为什么？因为照他们说的做就不会有事呗。该死……老子的生活怎么会变成这个鬼样子？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924354
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 你想检查什么地方？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924355
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924356
    m_Localized: 双手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924357
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924358
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924359
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924360
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924361
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 嗯……牙、牙齿？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924362
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 要是能帮上忙的话……好、好的，看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924363
    m_Localized: 'Cold: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924364
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 我三不五时会咬、咬破自己的舌头，只为感受鲜血给予的一点温、温暖。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924365
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 以此提醒自己，我还活着。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924366
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924367
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924368
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 指、指甲？看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924369
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 哎呀……我好像把它们都给扯掉了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924370
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 不过，应该没问题吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924371
    m_Localized: 'Cold: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924372
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 如何，我的指、指甲具备伪人的特征吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924373
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924374
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924375
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 如今这个世道，眼睛已经不是心、心灵的窗户……而是地狱的大门。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924376
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 我们的内在早就已经燃、燃烧殆尽。也许……正因如此，我才会感到无比寒、寒冷。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924377
    m_Localized: 'Cold: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924378
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 瞳、瞳孔出现了收缩？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924379
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 大概，是这股寒、寒意导致的吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924380
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 然而……即便这样，太阳也还是会令我灼、灼伤。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924381
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 不过，起码，同时也会收获一丝温、温暖。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924382
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924383
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924384
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 哎呀……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924385
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 我……需要一点时间。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924386
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 稍、稍等……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924387
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 好了……看吧。不过，还请快、快些。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924388
    m_Localized: 'Cold: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924389
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 之所以会答应这个要求，主要是出于对你的尊重。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924390
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 像这样一丝不挂……令、令我感到不快。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924391
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924392
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924393
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 一张照片是能证、证明什么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924394
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 难道，你就不觉得奇怪？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924395
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 不、不过……这并非我能决定的事情就对了，来吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924396
    m_Localized: 'Cold: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924397
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 如何，有什么不对劲的地方吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924398
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 也给我看、看看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924399
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924400
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924401
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 我们的身、身体，只不过是一个又一个的空洞罢了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924402
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 也许，正因如此……大、大家才会这么容易就消失得无影无踪吧，仅、仅仅只需要一转身的工夫。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924403
    m_Localized: 'Cold: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924404
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 早、早晚，就连最为亲、亲密的人……也会突然不见踪影。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924405
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924406
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924407
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 看、看来，很快……就没有必要继续这样做了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924408
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924409
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924410
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 的确……在这种情况下，你根、根本就没有办法好好检查我的双、双手。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924411
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 不过，要、要是可以的话……先别开枪，好吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924412
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 我想要告诉你一、一些事情。只是……只是……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924413
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924414
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924415
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 难道，是蛰、蛰伏在内心深处的杀人凶手占据了你的心智？我的眼睛一、一点也不红、没有遍布血丝。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924416
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 好、好吧。既然如此，就不要再犹、犹豫不决了。等待要比死、死亡更加痛苦，难熬。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924417
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924418
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924419
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 难道，是长出了真、真菌？大概，是因为我还会出、出汗的缘故吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924420
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 我的身体正、正在与某种东西作斗争……然而，一切都是徒劳。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924421
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924422
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924423
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 我能留、留着这张照片吗？毕竟……从来都没、没人给我拍过照。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924424
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 感觉还挺、挺不错。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924425
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924426
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924427
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 你……在那片虚、虚空之中看到了什么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924428
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 难、难道，是令你想起了自己？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924429
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924430
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924431
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 谢、谢谢你的信任。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924432
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 我希、希望，自己能帮上一点忙。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924433
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 我一直在纠结某件事情，只是……目前还没、没有办法跟你讲。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924434
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 其实，我已经再也不、不想以这样的状态活下去了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924435
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 然而，你并没有杀、杀了我。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924436
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 与此同、同时……在某个地方，却有人在自己的房子里惨、惨遭毒手。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924437
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 你有没有想过……这都是为什么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924438
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 我的双眼早就已经失、失去生机。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924439
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 剩下的只有无边无际的孤、孤独。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924440
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 我无法与他人建立起亲密的关系。因为……这样只、只会带来痛苦，以及挫败。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924441
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 我好怀念过去安、安静的生活。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924442
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 没有什、什么灭顶之灾。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924443
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 还位于食、食物链的顶端，还能走在太、太阳底下。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924444
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 只是，当时，我就已经感到无比寒冷，不敢脱下这件夹克就对了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924445
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 你说，究竟还要找出多、多少项特征，他们才能解决目前的危机，结、结束这一切？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924446
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 为什么非得有人丧、丧命？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924447
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 又或者说……其实，全都可、可以避免？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924448
    m_Localized: 'Cold: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924449
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 抱歉。我、我不该问这么多私人的问题。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924450
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 不想回、回答也没事。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924451
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 我只是觉得……问问也无妨，仅此而已。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924452
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 大、大概，也是徒劳。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924453
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 你知道吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924454
    m_Localized: 'Cold: 我想……我终于知道自己为什么会感到如此寒、寒冷了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924455
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924456
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924457
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 你是在侮辱我们吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924458
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 我丈夫活着的时候，没人向他伸出援手、得不到应有的尊重……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924459
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 然而，当他已经不在的时候……却竟然想要拍下他的死亡？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924460
    m_Localized: 'Widow: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924461
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 我无言以对。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924462
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 想做什么都随便你，好了之后就赶紧走。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924463
    m_Localized: 'Widow: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924464
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 快点离开！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924465
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924466
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924467
    m_Localized: 'Widow: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924468
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 你想怎样？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924469
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 我的耐心已经全都消耗殆尽了。我再也无法忍受任何的扯淡了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924470
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924471
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924472
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 想也知道，照片上的灵光……出于悲伤，肯定是极致的湛蓝。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924473
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 理由？你心知肚明，你很清楚这一切对我来说有多么的难以承受。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924474
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 然而……你却还是不断地折磨着我。到底是为什么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924475
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924476
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924477
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 即便这样……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924478
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 我也不知道该跟你说些什么。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924479
    m_Localized: 'Widow: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924480
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 看来，你找到了自己想要的东西？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924481
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924482
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924483
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 与他的最后一张合照。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924484
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 最后留下来的，竟然……是这样的东西？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924485
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 而且，随着时间的流逝，也一定会出现褶皱、变得破损、逐渐褪色。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924486
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 我已经再也无法跟他说话了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924487
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 我想休息了。你能离开吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924488
    m_Localized: 'Widow: 放心，我哪里也不去，只会静静地坐在这里。希望你可以让我独自整理内心的各种思绪。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924489
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924490
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924491
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 想跟我合影？行啊，走着。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924492
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 不过我光敏症发作会抽搐一下。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924493
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924494
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 瞧？我说什么来着？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924495
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 什么东西啊，只能拍出个黑影？白摆姿势了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924496
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 什么东西啊，镜头都没擦干净就拍！这拍的什么玩意儿！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924497
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924498
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931032924499
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 这骗局老子早玩过了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118464
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 你先检查，唬人说他们体内有伪人灵，然后收封口费。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118465
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 耳朵可以给你看，但别想坑我。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118466
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118467
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 我没问题对吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118468
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118469
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118470
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 玩我呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118471
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 我打牌输掉姑妈的房子都没这么惨……现在为张破照片命都要没了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118472
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118473
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118474
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 都跟你说过了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118475
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 穷得裤兜掏洞，钱全喂老虎机了……一个子儿没剩。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118476
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118477
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118478
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 别跟我耍这套！要骗骗那些冤大头去。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118479
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 就得让他们哆嗦着。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118480
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 这帮人过舒坦了……谁还记得这儿谁说话管用？谁还交钱？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118481
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 嚯！刚才差点尿裤子！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118482
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 别担心我，反正住这儿又不用交租！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118483
    m_Localized: 'Scammer: 马上搞点快钱……买新房子，过有钱日子！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118484
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118485
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118486
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 拍照？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118487
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 我没拍过几张照片。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118488
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 拍完能给我看看吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118489
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118490
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 唔。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118491
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 谢谢你。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118492
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 我不喜欢，千万别再找我拍照了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118493
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 爸爸说要小心寄生虫、蜱虫和别的小虫子爬进耳朵里。你是不是想看有没有虫子？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118494
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118495
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 谢谢你跟爸爸一样帮我检查耳朵。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118496
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 等爸爸来接我，我会跟他说你不是伪人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118497
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 他应该很快就会来接我了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118498
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 你想检查什么地方？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118499
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118500
    m_Localized: 双手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118501
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118502
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118503
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118504
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118505
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 哈哈哈，牙齿？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118506
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 好啦，宝贝。自己看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118507
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118508
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 如何？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118509
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 怎么，难道……只因为像我这样的老太婆想给牙齿做个陶瓷贴片，就要被赶尽杀绝？他们怕是迟早要完蛋。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118510
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118511
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118512
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 这恐怕有点麻烦。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118513
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 变老并不是一件令人开心的事情，宝贝。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118514
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118515
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 我的指甲一直都在脱落……哎呀，这是叫什么病来着？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118516
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 总之，疼得要命。特别难搞。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118517
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118518
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118519
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 我的眼睛里总会有那么几根微血管是破裂的状态。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118520
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 不太清楚你到底要怎么判断我是不是伪人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118521
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118522
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 好了。接着，该怎么办？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118523
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118524
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118525
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 我只不过是个老太婆罢了，这副身体早就不再中用咯。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118526
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118527
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 总是会痒个不停，不知道该怎么办。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118528
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 虽然也试过一些法子，不过……都没有什么效果。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118529
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118530
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118531
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 已经好几年没人给我拍过照了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118532
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 来吧，又有何不可呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118533
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118534
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 为什么我整个人都模糊不清的？只剩下一些污渍，还有斑点。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118535
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118536
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118537
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 每天晚上，我都会听到一些莫名其妙的刮擦声。就好像……有什么东西来爬来爬去一样。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118538
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118539
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 哎呀，该死！快、快点，抓住它，干掉它！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118540
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118541
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118542
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 霰弹枪？宝贝，靠这东西，怕是不好解决那群家伙。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118543
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 最好在背后捅刀。又或者是……下毒。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118544
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118545
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118546
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 没有必要担心，我这双手还灵着呢。不光能顾好自己，也许……甚至，还能顾好你们这群瘦骨嶙峋的家伙呢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118547
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118548
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118549
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 过去的三年里，我的视力可以说是每况愈下。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118550
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 看来……这些爆掉了的血管，应该是不会再自愈了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118551
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 或许，是罹癌了也说不定。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118552
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118553
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118554
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 哈哈哈！这把霰弹枪……还真是”万应灵药“！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118555
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 好了，还等什么，不是要”治疗“一下我这可怜的老妇吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118556
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118557
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118558
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 蛤，灵光？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118559
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 搞什么鬼，宝贝？看来……你是那种眼看着别人在拿自己的钱，不光不会上前阻止、还在旁边赔笑的的白痴。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118560
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 真是有趣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118561
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118562
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118563
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 等等，你以为我想要跑？误会大了！快点帮忙抓住那只蟑螂！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118564
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 我特别讨厌害虫，该死……这只甚至钻进了我的耳朵。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118565
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118566
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118567
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 最好还是克制一点，不要总拿这东西出来吓人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118568
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 今天指着我、明天指着他……再这样下去，早晚会换来大家的睥睨。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118569
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 再说，你也不可能一整天都抱着这把霰弹枪。懂我的意思吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118570
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 杀掉我这种年老、体弱的妇人，到底有何意义呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118571
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 没错……你当然可以说，是为了让我解脱、免受苦痛。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118572
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 然而，我并不介意再苟且一阵子。哈哈哈。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118573
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 没错，这怎么可能会是一项特征呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118574
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 万一手滑了、开枪了，就太糟糕了，对吧？毕竟，一条无辜的生命会因此陨落。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118575
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 不知，这种事情……你做过几遍了？你感受过……这份罪孽的沉重吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118576
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 最近刚好听说了这样的一句话，要是再也感觉不到哪怕一丁点的疼痛了的话，也就意味着你已经死了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118577
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 并不是只有上了年纪的人会这样。如今，人人均是如此……每时每刻，都在腐烂。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118578
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 我能留着这张照片吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118579
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 毕竟，我已经没有其他照片了。虽然不是很喜欢这张……不过，还是留着吧，有何不可呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118580
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 你呢，宝贝？有没有虫子爬进过你的嘴巴、或是其他什么地方？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118581
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 我这副病入膏肓的身体，就数这对耳朵最健康了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118582
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 希望那只该死的蟑螂没有在我的大脑边上产卵。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118583
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 来吧，开枪。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118584
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 我死了之后，它们自会前来、把你，以及这里的其他住客给煎皮拆骨。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118585
    m_Localized: 'Greatmother: 你把所有人都害死啦哈哈哈！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118586
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118587
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118588
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: 这又是闹哪出？给我这老骨头浪费胶卷？这玩意儿金贵着呢……非要拍？倒是给我长脸啦！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118589
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118590
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: 好了，现在怎么说？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118591
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118592
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118593
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: 哈！瞧你这心思多的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118594
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118595
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: 我甚至听得到一根细针掉落地面的时候发出的声音。不过，你知道吗？有时……我总感觉自己好像就根本不存在一样。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118596
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: 就……仿佛，只有透过极其微弱的光线才能看到我。而且，还不是每次都能见到。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118597
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118598
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118599
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: 怎么，你连老太太也要杀？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118600
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118601
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118602
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: 这能说明啥呀，宝贝儿？一对耳朵还能告密不成？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118603
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118604
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118605
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: 我们那会儿只有阔佬才搞这个！现在是个活人都能用上了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118606
    m_Localized: 'NotTrue: 没什么话跟你说了。净犯傻……折腾老实人图啥呢……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118607
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118608
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118609
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 说实话……我并不相信什么灵光不灵光的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118610
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 我们所作的一切、我们所去的地方，全都出于我们的个人意志，与所谓的灵光、星座，以及其他诸如此类的东西没有任何的关系。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118611
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118612
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 好了……如何？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118613
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118614
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118615
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 等等……这是哪项特征来着？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118616
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 你，是在找什么来着？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118617
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118618
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 好了。怎样，得出结论了吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118619
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118620
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118621
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 等等……难道，你真的相信这种天方夜谭？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118622
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118623
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118624
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 你，为什么会觉得我是个伪人？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118625
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 该死……到底是什么东西把你的火药桶给点着了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118626
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118627
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118628
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 所以……你只是想开个玩笑而已？千万不要再这样做了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118629
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 我早就因为自己丈夫的事情而坐立不安、心烦意乱了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118630
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 他……他应该快到了。他会来帮我、还有我的姊妹的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118631
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 吓死我了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118632
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 希望应急中心知道自己在做什么。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118633
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 至于这些所谓的特征……我不好说。有时，我会觉得都是在胡扯。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118634
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 然而，有时，我又会觉得都是真的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118635
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118636
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118637
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118638
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118639
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 我并不在乎到底有没有东西可以留下来。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118640
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 想怎么做，都随便你。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118641
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118642
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 这是什么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118643
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118644
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118645
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 我还戴着一只耳环。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118646
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 能令我想起父母。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118647
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118648
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 我的姊妹并没有戴着她的那只。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118649
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 我也应该取下我的那只。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118650
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 毕竟……会令她想起父母，因此而陷入悲痛之中。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118651
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118652
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118653
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 记得把这张照片也一起烧了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118654
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118655
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118656
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 不要犹豫。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118657
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 该怎么做，就怎么做。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118658
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118659
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118660
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 你为什么总在检查过后掏出枪来，却又从不开火？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118661
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 要知道，伪人并不会因为被人拿枪指着就伺机暴起、突然袭击。它们绝对不会主动暴露自己的真实身份。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118662
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 总有更简单的方法……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118663
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 你觉得……我们会死于什么东西的手上？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118664
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 伪人？又或者说，天灾，甚至，人祸？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118665
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 还有……这一时刻，又会在什么时候来临？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118666
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118667
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118668
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 想检查什么地方？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118669
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118670
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118671
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118672
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118673
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118674
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118675
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 小心点儿。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118676
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 你敢对我不客气，我就咬断你喉咙。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118677
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118678
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 我牙齿都保养得很好。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118679
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 至于丢了的那颗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118680
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 就让躺坟堆里的混账好好攥着吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118681
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118682
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118683
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 你想听我说说这双手都干了什么吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118684
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 没错，我最近是用它杀了人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118685
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 那是因为对方要杀我。我可不是坐以待毙的人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118686
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 危机面前，有的人会僵住，有的人会逃跑。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118687
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 我会还手。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118688
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118689
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 满意了么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118690
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118691
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118692
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 你是想在我身上找到异乡人的影子么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118693
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 你就不怕在我眼中看到自己的倒影么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118694
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118695
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 了不起。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118696
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 没几个人受得了我的凝视。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118697
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118698
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118699
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 这种作派，我看不上。我会记住的'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118700
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118701
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 除臭剂让皮肤皲裂……但总比发臭强'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118702
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 男人没啥可隐藏就该坦荡'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118703
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118704
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118705
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 我讨厌拍照'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118706
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 这些照片要是敢外流……我会采取行动。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118707
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 懂么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118708
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 放手。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118709
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 瞧你拍成了什么鬼样子！不能留你手里。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118710
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 交出来……我自己处理。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118711
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118712
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118713
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 接下来，是不是要问，”你的牙齿为什么会这么大？“妈的，真是疯了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118714
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118715
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 也许，我该趁你还保有一丝理智的时候把你塞进拘束衣里、免得你开始伤害自己。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118716
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118717
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118718
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 香烟不仅会毁掉那些不懂得分享的家伙，也会让牙龈变得松软、令咬合力下降。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118719
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 怎么，难道，你认为我之前没被人拿枪指过？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118720
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118721
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118722
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 怎么，你要扣下扳机吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118723
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 完了之后，又该怎样？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118724
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118725
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118726
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 看到自己的倒影了，是吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118727
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 我可不会就此罢休。即便死了，我也会在来世跟你算清这笔帐，一定会把你给煎皮、拆骨。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118728
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118729
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118730
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 不仅强迫一个成年男性按照自己的意愿行事，然后，甚至还对其加以威胁、恐吓。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118731
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 要是在我老家的话，你这种家伙甚至就连一天都活不下去。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118732
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118733
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118734
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 拿枪到处乱指……是不会令你赢得他人尊重的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118735
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 你要知道，权威来自于尊重、而非恐惧。要是再像这样下去、把大家都搞得筋疲力竭的话，他们，我们，早晚会把你给推翻。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118736
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118737
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118738
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 不够果断、不够果决。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118739
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 既然，你这么喜欢独自一人……又为什么要苦苦维持现在这种与他人为伴的状态呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118740
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 赶紧把大家都宰了、一了百了得了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118741
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118742
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118743
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 千万不要再拿枪指着我了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118744
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 我知道你什么时候睡觉，我也知道你会睡多久、什么时候醒。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118745
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 要是敢再得寸进尺的话，孩子，就别怪我把你给生吞活剥了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118746
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 别犯错了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118747
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 我的动作要比你快。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118748
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 只要我有这个意思，随时都可以把枪给从你手上夺过来。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118749
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 没错，冷静一点，就是这样。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118750
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 我看错你了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118751
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 要是举起了武器、又不去使用的话，只会让对方知道自己的内心还存有疑惑，这可危险得很。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118752
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 你让我恶心。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118753
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 要是敢再耍什么廉价把戏的话，就别怪我不客气了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118754
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 开什么玩笑。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118755
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 你看起来就像一个拿到了危险的东西、却不知道该怎么去处理的孩子。现在，你正不断地用它砸着自己的手呢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118756
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 你迟早会害死自己。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118757
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 冷静一点。把责任交给能承其重的人吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118758
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 别再让自己蒙羞了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931037118759
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 我曾经摆脱过比这更加糟糕的局面。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312768
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 来啊，看看谁比较快。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312769
    m_Localized: 'Wolfhound: 啊，！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312770
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 你想看什么地方？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312771
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312772
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312773
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312774
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312775
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312776
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312777
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 谢谢关心，我的牙齿很健康。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312778
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 啊……你说的是伪人的特征吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312779
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 好的，尽管看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312780
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312781
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 完美无瑕，对吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312782
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 我的一个好友帮忙植的。而且，还是免费的呢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312783
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 因为，不久之前，我刚刚给他完成了一场非常成功的手术。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312784
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 不知，他现在怎么样了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312785
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312786
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312787
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 我这双手，给无数的病患做过手术。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312788
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 其中的故事甚至可以说上好几天……不过，还是先留到下次吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312789
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 现在，还是先进行检查好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312790
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312791
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 我会尽可能地让自己的双手维持在最佳的状态，从不会有一丝、一毫的松懈。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312792
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 毕竟，谁也不知道明天会发生什么事情。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312793
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312794
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312795
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 好的。眼睛是吗？随便看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312796
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 不知道你之前有没有注意到，其实，我患有多瞳症。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312797
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 也就是说，一个眼球里同时具有复数瞳孔。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312798
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312799
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 比较反直觉的是，这一症状并没有令我的视力变好、反而更差。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312800
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 我想，绝大多数的人应该会觉得一个眼球里有两个瞳孔会非常方便吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312801
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 然而……事与愿违。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312802
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312803
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312804
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 好的。稍等一下，我的动作已经没有年轻时那么俐落了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312805
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312806
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 我会尽可能地让自己保持干净、整洁。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312807
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 毕竟，在这样一个世界里……你永远不知道明天是否能有机会洗澡、或是得整整一周都维持着脏兮兮的模样。哈哈。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312808
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312809
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312810
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 没问题。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312811
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 我能理解，你想尽可能地排除任何不稳定的因素。因此，就连这种检查也不会放过。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312812
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312813
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 大家都说我长相怪异。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312814
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 你觉得呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312815
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312816
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312817
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 好的。我相信你知道自己在做什么。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312818
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312819
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 既然我还好端端地站在这里，就说明，你做出了正确的决定。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312820
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312821
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312822
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 等等，这是要干什么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312823
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 你错了，我的本质是救死扶伤、而非夺取性命！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312824
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 反而是你，正要杀害一个无辜的人……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312825
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312826
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312827
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 等等，医生的双手……要是不去消毒的话，该长什么样？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312828
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 说说看吧。既然如此，在你看来……寻常人类的双手又该长什么样？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312829
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312830
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312831
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 真有意思。唉……可惜的是，我已经没有办法去深入研究你的这种偏执心里是怎样形成的了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312832
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 不过，这也不是我的专业领域就对了。因此，大概也得不出什么像样的结论。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312833
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312834
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312835
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 扣下扳机之前，还请务必三思。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312836
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 又或者是……先检查其他地方，好好确认一下。不要因为一时冲动而丢了大局。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312837
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312838
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312839
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 真有意思。你竟然会相信这些所谓的……灵光照片？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312840
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 难不成，你甚至会待在电视前、给自己要喝的水注入一些什么乱七八糟的能量？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312841
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312842
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312843
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 毕竟在医院工作了这么久，我早就已经与死亡和解了。现在，我只对一件事情感到疑惑，为什么大家都如此拼命地想要活下去？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312844
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 毕竟在医院工作了这么久，我早就已经习惯与死亡为伴了。不过……不管怎样，还是希望可以好好地活着，这是人之常情。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312845
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312846
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312847
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 要是你有这个意思的话，我也可以帮忙矫正牙齿。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312848
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 当然，只会象征性地收取一点费用。毕竟，你可是帮了我大忙。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312849
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 等太阳不再爆发、一切尘埃落定时，就这样做吧，我们说好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312850
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 当然，再怎么小心、谨慎也不为过。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312851
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 只是，万一因此做出了错误的决心，你真的能背负这沉重的罪孽，继续活下去吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312852
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 非常吓人，对吧？如今这个世道，恐惧不受掌控、四处蔓延。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312853
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: FEMA本该挺身而出、承担这项责任，然而……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312854
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 唉，这么说好了，我并不指望他们能帮上任何的忙。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312855
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 切勿冲动行事。一定要始终保持头脑的清醒，看清大局。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312856
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 这是我在医院里学到的教训。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312857
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 也是我之所以得离开的理由。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312858
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 说说看，你为什么会相信所谓的灵光？按下快门之后，你真的有感应到什么东西吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312859
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 无意冒犯，不过……为什么要这样轻而易举地就相信了FEMA所提出的这项检查？你不觉得，这套说辞更像是为了安抚大众的情绪而临时东拼西凑出来的吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312860
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 我这辈子亲眼目睹过太多、太多的苦难……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312861
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 有时，你会想不通，人生究竟有何意义？感觉一切都是徒劳无功、白费力气，只有痛苦。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312862
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 然而，却依旧没人愿意放弃。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312863
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 就来看看，我们究竟能坚持到什么时候好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312864
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 不、不，不要开枪，拜托……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312865
    m_Localized: 'Doctor: 我只不过是个医生罢了，仅此而已……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312866
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 沃布字到……腻像撍麽养？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312867
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312868
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312869
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312870
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312871
    m_Localized: 照片
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312872
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312873
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 窝得...嘴叭？妹搓，只前北轰德四四得。现宰，该怎摸板？南捣，咬小衣格？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312874
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: ......'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312875
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 染猴，该怎摸板？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312876
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312877
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312878
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 爽受？嚎德。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312879
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: ......'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312880
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 尾和药着痒坐？尾了...消磨时艰？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312881
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312882
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312883
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 盐经？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312884
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: ......'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312885
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 窝还似不懂腻尾和药着痒坐，游与太洋灰卓尚世亡末，印词窝紧亮不灰取勘塔。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312886
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312887
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312888
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 窝翼精衣偷污税了...碍亚，碎鞭了、碎鞭了...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312889
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: ......'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312890
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 蛮蚁了嘛？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312891
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312892
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312893
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 找偏宰哪离讷？应盖把塔给挂起籁！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312894
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: ......'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312895
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 刻译给窝勘勘嘛？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312896
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312897
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312898
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 酒似爽噗噗同同得儿躲，金刺饵伊。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312899
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: ......'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312900
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 堆了，海逮折窝琴挨德捧由松得儿患。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312901
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: ......'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312902
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312903
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312904
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 羔什魔龟？窝不似安照腻烁德取左了嘛？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312905
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312906
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312907
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 块电把墙放呷！窝兵妹游做过认喝桑害腻德事情！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312908
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312909
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312910
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 白脱——窝兵不似什魔怀任！只似羽腻于岩不瞳儿伊！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312911
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312912
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312913
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 白脱，祝寿！南捣，腻缝了嘛？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312914
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312915
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312916
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 哈哈...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312917
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312918
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312919
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 万了只猴，油该怎摸羊？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312920
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312921
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312922
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 阵似火不蛋星。只前贝任讲嘴叭给桑着了，现宰贝任娜墙只折、儿切姬湖久药扣呷扳机了...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312923
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 窝阵盖嚎嚎第吸衣呷寿...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312924
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 盐经酒似盐经，尽次儿伊——尾合药呷湖窝？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312925
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 井髯灰嚄药检查折种地防...嚎嚄，不台堆镜...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312926
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 窝恨希环折篇。不过，勘籁腻并不嚒肿羽次——堆嘛？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312927
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 窝远翼府厨衣且带假，只为宰箭獺衣麵...窝嚎嚄塔。阵似遗憾——折呆彪蛰什魔嘛？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312928
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 勘籁，衣窃酒到刺尾汁了。妹任能停懂窝烁德花，达嘉斗堆窝比汁不几...儿切，什只...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312929
    m_Localized: 'Foreigner: 药了窝德命...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312930
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 我所拥有的一切，早就已经成为了一段又一段的过往。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312931
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312932
    m_Localized: 双手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312933
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312934
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312935
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312936
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312937
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 我还记得她美丽的牙齿……我很喜欢她绽放的笑容……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312938
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312939
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 至于我的……则像被雨水淋湿过后、搁置了太久的秋叶。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312940
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 而这……就是爱的代价。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312941
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312942
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312943
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 她的双手是如此的柔软。甚至，偶尔会令我担心，它们会不会如同幽灵一般，融入我的躯体……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312944
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312945
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 我的右手，已经不属于自己了。一点、一滴地……在腐烂着。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312946
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 我的左手，则安然无恙。看到上面的指甲了吧？干净、整洁。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312947
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312948
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312949
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 甚至，只要一想起她的眼睛、就会令我感到心神不宁……抱歉，你想要看的、是我的眼睛……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312950
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312951
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 大家都说，经常哭泣的人，眼睛的颜色会变得较为暗沉。不过，我已经很久没有流下过泪水了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312952
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 我已经不再执着去寻找她的容颜。学会接受，向来是最难的一课。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312953
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 然而，该说是旧习难改吗……我依旧会不断地去寻找她的身影。即便只用眼角的余光扫过，也希望能捕捉到一丝踪迹。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312954
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312955
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312956
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 好的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312957
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312958
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 要是长时间不活动一下的话，会令身体感到不适。起初，为了她，我勉强自己维持着相同的姿势。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312959
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 然而，后来发现……这样根本没有任何意义。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312960
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 要是长时间不活动一下的话，会令身体感到不适。然而，我别无选择。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312961
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312962
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312963
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 好吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312964
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312965
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 如何……我上相吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312966
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 不过，更重要的是……你看到了什么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312967
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312968
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312969
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 一如既往。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312970
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312971
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 我的耳朵应该是这副躯体上为数不多、从未改变的事物之一了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312972
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312973
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312974
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 难道，你是想让我感到害怕吗？不，我的朋友，这副皮囊只不过是一具空壳罢了，早已分崩离析。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312975
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312976
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312977
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 要是可以的话，我希望能以自己设想的方式离世、而非如此……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312978
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312979
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312980
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 就让我以自己设想的方式离世吧。没有必要浪费你宝贵的弹药……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312981
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312982
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312983
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 你知道吗？要是长久以来都与某人为伴的话……你就会逐渐染上对方的特质。我觉得，自己已经成为她的一部分了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312984
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312985
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312986
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 真有意思……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312987
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312988
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312989
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 好吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312990
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312991
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312992
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 你知道吗？每当她亲吻我，都会觉得……也许，那就是最后一次。现在，我终于明白她为什么会这样想了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312993
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 我曾经费尽心思地想要保住这只手……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312994
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 心想，只要身上还有某个地方能保持干净、整洁的话，也许就能成为一份念想。然而，现在……又有什么意义呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312995
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 没错，这样要比较好。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312996
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 每当凝视她的双眸，我都感觉……里面有着一片不同的天空。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312997
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 然而，现在……只剩一片虚无。只剩一个不断把我给拉扯进去的黑洞。凝望得越久，我就越清楚地知道……这并不是她的目光，只不过是一缕余响罢了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312998
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 陌生的字句，陌生的音色，死者，竟在替她发声。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041312999
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 奇怪……大家总说，要是生者在逝者身边徘徊得太久的话、就会从他们身上染到一些什么。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313000
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 万一……事实刚好相反，该怎么办？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313001
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 照片只能捕获表面，而非灵魂。如果我是个画家，就会将她的神韵给好好地记录在帆布之上。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313002
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 然而，我只是个无可救药的浪漫主义者……因此，只能令她活在我的回忆之中，直至，我也离开这个世界的那天。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313003
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 她特别喜欢在我的耳边轻声细语。只是……我并不知道她都说了些什么。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313004
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 也许，是因为我一厢情愿地认为都是一些温柔的话语吧。然而，她却早已不在人世……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313005
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 我来找你了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313006
    m_Localized: 'Edgar: 我的挚爱……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313007
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 哎呀，呃……兄弟，千万不要误会。我并不是说不行，只是……唉，你等一下就会明白了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313008
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313009
    m_Localized: 双手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313010
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313011
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313012
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313013
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313014
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 不就是牙齿吗？能有什么特别的呢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313015
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 我一直都很爱护它们。我还记得……小时候甚至还特地去做过美白。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313016
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313017
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 我的老爸经常说“笑容就是门面”。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313018
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313019
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313020
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 我也知道，的确……不太好看就对了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313021
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313022
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 就是一双平淡无奇的手……要是我并不抽烟的话，现在八成早就因为过度紧张而把手指给抠得流血了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313023
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 就是一双平凡无奇的手……没错，我也知道，指甲很脏。我总是会习惯性地抠弄方向盘。这样的话，就……呃，能维持住自己的情绪，不至于崩溃。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313024
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 总不能把客人给吓跑了嘛，哈哈。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313025
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313026
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313027
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 我的眼睛总是非常疲惫。主要是，想闭上也难。不知，你能否理解？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313028
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313029
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 因为，已经……习惯成自然了。会下意识地去留意身边的一切事物。譬如，谁在后方行驶、谁在盯着我看、谁长时间没有说话，诸如此类。大概，可以说是职业病？完全甩不掉。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313030
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 现在，甚至已经开始有点失眠了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313031
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313032
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 自从车子被他们给扣走之后，我就夜不能寐。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313033
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 你知道吗？我养成了职业病，会下意识地去留意谁在后方行驶、谁在盯着我看、谁长时间没有说话，诸如此类……完全甩不掉。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313034
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313035
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313036
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 没什么特别的，真的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313037
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313038
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 要是开车时间太长的话，我的手臂就会感到一阵酸痛。你知道吗？有时，甚至就连整条手臂都抬不起来。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313039
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 不过，我也已经习惯了就是了。特别是现在……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313040
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313041
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313042
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 拍吧，兄弟，我已经准备好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313043
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313044
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 好了……你看到了什么？大概，就只有我吧。不会有什么问题的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313045
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 我的车里曾经放了一些我跟老爸一起拍的照片。现在……会给我拍照的，大概就只有那些到处在检查别人的家伙了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313046
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 哎呀，不对，还有你呢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313047
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313048
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313049
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 我的耳朵？就跟大家一样，没什么特别的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313050
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313051
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 我擅长倾听，乘客总是自然而然地就会侃侃而谈、说个没完。我从不打断他们，只是……静静地听着。把那些事情给记下来。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313052
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 不过，有时……听到的事情也太多了点就是了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313053
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313054
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313055
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 冷静，兄弟，冷静！我并没有疯，只是……这一切，从那时就开始了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313056
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 怎么说呢，牙齿……总会令我想起个人，很坏很坏的人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313057
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 我老爸曾经与他有过一次交集……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313058
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 从那之后，我就开始抽烟了。你也看到了吧，我的牙齿都因为这样、变成这种样子了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313059
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313060
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313061
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 唉……兄弟，你这是在开什么玩笑？开车，其实就跟活受罪没什么两样，你应该能理解吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313062
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 为了解压，有人会猛砸方向盘、有人会大吼大叫，还有人会挥拳发泄。每个人都有自己的应对方式。拜托，别这样吓我……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313063
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313064
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313065
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 拜托，兄弟。我并不傻。我知道你把我当成了伪人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313066
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 然而，大错特错。你真的要对一个无辜的人扣下扳机吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313067
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313068
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313069
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 好吧，想开枪的话、就尽管动手。一了百了。反正，也从来没人护过我。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313070
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313071
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313072
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 要是这台相机早就已经下了定论的话……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313073
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 我也没什么好说的了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313074
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313075
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313076
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 听好，兄弟，要是你有什么事情憋在心里、想要一吐为快的话，我很乐意听你说。我很擅长当个听众。毕竟……我自己的故事，实在是没有什么好说的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313077
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313078
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931041313079
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 你大概在想……既然抽烟把我的牙齿都毁成了这副鬼样，为什么还不戒烟呢，对吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507072
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 你大概在想……我为什么会漂白自己的牙齿，对吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507073
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 因为，这样一来……我就会看起来像是另一个人。而不是当年他上车时，坐在后座的那个乳臭未干的小孩。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507074
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 那个家伙……是本地的大人物。人人都知道他是谁，就连我这个小鬼也不例外。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507075
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 表面上看跟普通人没什么区别。就是特别喜欢抽烟。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507076
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 表面上看跟普通人没什么区别。就是，一旦咧开嘴、笑起来……就能看到他那口如同瓷器一般洁白的牙齿。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507077
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 那天……老爸做了一个错误的决定，我们都因此付出了代价。之后，只能像过街老鼠一样、东躲西藏。没了房子，也没了积蓄，当然，也没了安宁。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507078
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 我曾经以为双手象征着力量、代表着控制，不管是掌握车子的前行，抑或是掌握人生的方向。然而，现在……唉，已经再也没有任何意义了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507079
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 我一直在留意自己周遭的情况。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507080
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 一边寻找下一个乘客，一边好奇他们是不是真的跟自己说的一样。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507081
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 要是因此而吓到了你的话，我愿意道歉。既然车子都已经没有了，也许……我也该改掉这个习惯了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507082
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 我偶尔会想……要是当时还有别人能看护我的话，也许，我就不会坐在车子的后座、跟爸爸一起出勤。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507083
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 也许，我们就不会被他喊停，就不会……失去一切。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507084
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 也许，你终究还是在我的身上看到了一丝人性。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507085
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 虽然，我并不是什么完人。不过，我真的有努力过了，真的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507086
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 话说……你知道吗？乘客安安静静地坐在后排、一言不发，这，反而是最可怕的事情。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507087
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 因为，这样一来、就会开始听到自己内心的声音，甚至比收音机的声音还要大。完全无法停下，怎么也甩不掉……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507088
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 要是可以的话，把我的骨灰给洒向风中，好吗？我并不想睡在泥巴里。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507089
    m_Localized: 'TaxiDriver: 咳嗽我并不想……曝尸荒野。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507090
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 看来，你有看电视、而且信了关于伪人的整套说辞，是吧？行吧，随你喜欢。要检查的话，请自便。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507091
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507092
    m_Localized: 双手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507093
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507094
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507095
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507096
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507097
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 好吧。我猜，看完之后，是不是还得挑毛病？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507098
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507099
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 如何，满意了吗？又或者说，只因为我刷了牙，你就要打爆我的头？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507100
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507101
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507102
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 我的手？我手怎么了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507103
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507104
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 难道，你想说，因为我的指甲缝里有污垢，所以……我是个伪人？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507105
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 难道，你想说，因为我没有修剪指甲，所以……我是个伪人？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507106
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507107
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507108
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 归根到底，你究竟想在我的眼里看到什么，红肿、血丝？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507109
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 归根到底，你究竟想在我的眼里看到什么，自己这幅凶神恶煞的表情？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507110
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507111
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 看到了吗？没有一点问题，对吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507112
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 难不成，你还能发现什么不对劲的地方？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507113
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507114
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507115
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 蛤，腋下？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507116
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507117
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 我习惯把腋毛给剃干净，我很讨厌出汗之后那种黏糊糊的感觉。难道，你想说……正因如此，我是个伪人？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507118
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507119
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507120
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 哦，想拍照是吧……该不会，你还要我给你笑一个吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507121
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 没事，拍呗，有何不可呢？相信，肯定可以证明一些什么的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507122
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507123
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507124
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507125
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 天啊。不管电视里说什么，你都不假思索、照单全收，是吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507126
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 万一他们说阴毛也是一项特征，该怎么办？难不成，你还是会让大家都脱下裤子、接受检查？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507127
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507128
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 好吧。就是想玩医生游戏，是吧？如何，看到什么了呢？耳垢？既然如此，你打算开一个什么方子呢，大夫？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507129
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507130
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507131
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 不出所料。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507132
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 好啊，尽管扣下扳机吧。只因为我有一口干净、整洁的牙齿，你就认定了我是个伪人，没错吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507133
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507134
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507135
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 搞什么鬼？只不过是指甲缝里沾了一点泥巴而已，我就成了个伪人？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507136
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 这次又怎么了？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507137
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507138
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507139
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 开什么玩笑，这次又怎么了？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507140
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507141
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507142
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 你不是在逗我吧？！我只不过是稍微抖了一下罢了，难道，这在你看来非常可疑？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507143
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 你不是在逗我吧？！你……竟然要从照片之中读取他人的”灵光“？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507144
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 干脆直接透过抛硬币来决定下一个遭殃的是谁得了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507145
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507146
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507147
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 你疯了吧？我只是剃掉了腋毛而已，怎么就成伪人了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507148
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 既然如此，是不是意味着，这些所谓的伪人不仅住在地下，甚至还随身带着剃刀？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507149
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507150
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 真是棒极了……即使没有任何的逻辑可言，又有什么关系呢？宁可信其有，不可信其无，是这个意思吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507151
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507152
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507153
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 不要每当看到某些与电视里说的特征对不上号的东西时，就掏出枪来指着别人的鼻子，好吗？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507154
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 还是说，你觉得的子弹是去除耳垢的灵药？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507155
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507156
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507157
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 哎呀，真是难得，看来，你还保留着最后一丝的理智！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507158
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 既然这么心急火燎地想要把住客给干掉的话……又为何要让他们，也就是我们，给住进来？你根本就是个彻头彻尾的疯子！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507159
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 拜托，别总是因为发现了什么微不足道的不符之处、就掏出枪来指着别人的鼻子，好吗？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507160
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 你的脑袋没问题吧？先是拿枪指着我，然后又收了起来、当作无事发生。你怕是已经疯了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507161
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 赶紧停止这出闹剧吧！根本就没有所谓的伪人！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507162
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 照这样下去，我迟早被你吓出一头白发！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507163
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 怎么，难道，为了逼迫我不再剃掉自己的腋毛，你甚至不惜拿出枪来威胁、恐吓我？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507164
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 真是令人口瞪目呆……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507165
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 不要指望因为你把枪给收起来了、没有打爆我的脑袋，我就会对你感恩戴德。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507166
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 你他妈的到底有什么毛病？就非得每次都把枪给掏出来，不然浑身不舒服，是这个意思吗？况且，耳垢又能代表什么？真的是，整个世界都疯了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507167
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 等等，你该不会……真的想要扣下扳机吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507168
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 住手！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507169
    m_Localized: 'Provocateur: 不要！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507170
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 好的，有何不可呢？反正，我也早就习惯别人对我侧目了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507171
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507172
    m_Localized: 双手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507173
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507174
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507175
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507176
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507177
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 哎呀，我之前也见过长成这样的牙齿。好吧，没问题，就先给你看看我的牙齿，再说故事好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507178
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507179
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 怎么？竟然露出了这种表情。没错，我从来都没刷过牙。之前不会，之后？也不会。我的牙齿，我做主。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507180
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 毕竟，毫无意义，不是吗？反正，不管怎样大家都会躲着我。既然如此，我还不如把多出来的水给喝下肚子、而不是浪费在刷牙这件事情上面。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507181
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507182
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507183
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 双手，掌心、指头。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507184
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507185
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 指甲……不太干净。毕竟，很快就会弄脏。也就没有必要洗了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507186
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 指甲……不太干净。没错……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507187
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 说来也是有趣。虽说脏得不行，然而，这双手却摸到过很多好东西、经手过无数财宝……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507188
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 虽然现在都已经不在身边了，不过……也无所谓了。起码，我成功地活了下来。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507189
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507190
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507191
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 只不过是一双平平无奇的眼睛罢了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507192
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507193
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 没什么特别的。喏，自己看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507194
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507195
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507196
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 我，蛤？该死……不擅长与他人来往的，到底是谁……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507197
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507198
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 没错，过敏了，痒得不行。不过，鉴于现在的这种状况……又能怎么办呢，对吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507199
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507200
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507201
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 拜托。真的有必要吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507202
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 好吧、好吧。这里是你的房子，自然由你说了算……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507203
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507204
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 难道，你真的认为，凭借这台机器，能看破我的内心？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507205
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507206
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507207
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 不像流浪动物那样被撕咬、啃食得破破烂烂，就是一只再普通不过的耳朵。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507208
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507209
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 满意了吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507210
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507211
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507212
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 怎么，现在……嘴里有几颗蛀牙，就要被判死刑了？行啊，你就尽管开枪好了。真没想到，如今的这个世界，竟然变成这样了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507213
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507214
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507215
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 真是讽刺，只因为拿了本已毫无用处的东西，就要把这个拾荒者给一枪打死。哈哈……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507216
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507217
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507218
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 你……究竟是对哪里感到不满？也许，我们可以像个文明人一样好好谈谈？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507219
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507220
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507221
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 听着，即便找到了什么药膏，我也会拿去卖了、而不是用在自己的身上。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507222
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507223
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507224
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 要是单凭一张照片，就能让你看清我是什么人的话……行啊，还等什么呢？动手吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507225
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 起码，这样一来，我就不用再过现在的这种生活了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507226
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507227
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507228
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 怎么，现在变成嫌弃我的耳朵了，是吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507229
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507230
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507231
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 之前，我曾经有过一个伙伴。只因为不小心搞丢了一颗牙齿里面的填补物，就整天愁眉苦脸的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507232
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 结果，后来……整颗脑袋都被人给砍了下来。我敢说，当时，他应该再也不在意这些事情了。不过……也不好说。唉，罢了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507233
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 我曾经找到过这样的一栋房子，看着空空如也，似乎没人住了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507234
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 当时……刚在架子上拿了一个应该还挺值钱的老旧怀表，就听到楼上传来了一些动静。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507235
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 把我给吓了个半死。也不管到底是不是真的有人在，就脚底抹油、立即溜了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507236
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 我在乎的……是那块怀表。不知，是不是还留在那里。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507237
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 这就对了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507238
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 嗯……这倒是令我想起了一件事情。我曾经找到过一副眼镜，儿童用的，非常迷你。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507239
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 捡起来之后，发现镜片上面还沾着模模糊糊的指纹。我不禁开始想像，这个孩子当初透过这副小小的眼镜看着大千世界的模样……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507240
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 现在？要嘛就是因为失去了这副眼镜、陷于困境，不断挣扎……要嘛就是，根本就已经什么都看不见了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507241
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 没错。的确会一连好几天都痒得不行、像是烧起来了一样，不过，我能忍受。又不是第一次了，而且……也不会是最后一次。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507242
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 我都已经忍了一辈子了。要是再有一次机会，我也还是会毫不犹豫地选择拿去卖了、换钱，正所谓，钱多不压身嘛。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507243
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 我曾经找到过一张家族合照，一对夫妻，两个孩子。笑得可灿烂了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507244
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 不禁令我好奇，他们之中，有人活下来了吗？又或者说，这张照片……就是仅剩的东西了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507245
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 一个人的时候，总会听到一些声音，吱呀的声响，细碎的耳语。就好像是有人在呼唤自己一样。结果，转过身去、谁都不在。然而，你还是得竖起耳朵、仔细听着……万一，真的有其他人呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507246
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 我就不该踏进这栋房子。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507247
    m_Localized: 'Marauder: 我就不该跟你这个混蛋搭话……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507248
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 啧……好吧，想怎么检查都可以。我没什么可隐瞒的。毕竟，里里外外、早就已经破烂不堪了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507249
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507250
    m_Localized: 双手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507251
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507252
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507253
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507254
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507255
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 要是挖得太深的话……最终，找到的并不一定只是骨头。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507256
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507257
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 这几颗整齐、洁白的牙齿，是我堂堂正正地挣来的。这几颗闪闪发亮的牙齿……这么说吧，是我在一口老旧的棺材里找到的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507258
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 不然，放着也是浪费。看看，现在这样反而是派上用场了，对吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507259
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507260
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507261
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 这双手养活了我、救活了我。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507262
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507263
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 指头就像老树盘根一样，粗糙、扭曲。指甲乌黑、甚至有点发亮，从来都没洗过。嵌在缝里的污泥，就如同这些年的回忆一般、挥之不去……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507264
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507265
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507266
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 每当夜幕降临，就是我开始工作的时候。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507267
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507268
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 谁会在日间埋葬死者呢？白天做事的家伙，抬头就能看到太阳。而我，只能与一旁的路灯、以及墓穴里面的阴影为伴。自那次之后，我总会下意识地警戒四周。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507269
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 双眼来回瞟着，提防着会不会有伪人悄悄靠近。这样的日子实在太过、太过的煎熬。真希望这一切能赶快结束。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507270
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 谁会在日间埋葬死者呢？白天做事的家伙，抬头就能看到太阳。而我，只能与一旁的路灯、以及墓穴里面的阴影为伴。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507271
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 也许，这样反而是最好的，之前没见过太阳，之后也永远不会……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507272
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507273
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507274
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 呃，你……还真是了不得。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507275
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507276
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 总是会痒，就好像有泥巴在我的皮肤下面爬动一样。唉，每天都要挥舞铲子、把死者装进麻袋、将棺材钉上板子……哪里有什么时间去剃毛呀。再说，又有谁在乎呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507277
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507278
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507279
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 照片……是个非常危险的东西，就跟镜子一样，会将你看到的画面永远地保留下来。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507280
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507281
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 哈……嗯，真是有趣。看起来就像是附着了阴影一样……大概，是镜头脏了吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507282
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507283
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507284
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507285
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 就是一双随处可见的耳朵而已。没什么特别的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507286
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507287
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 再普通不过了，对吧？既没有被烧伤、又没有要脱落，也还能听见声音……唉，为何……还能听见声音？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507288
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507289
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507290
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 好吧。要是想开枪的话，就随你好了。只是……不要对着这几颗金牙开枪，好吗？它们可以说是我的退休基金，哈哈。不然，即便死了，我说不定会变成伪人、回来缠着你……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507291
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507292
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507293
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 看来，也该轮到我了……这双手触碰过了太多的死者，现在，该成为他们的一员了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507294
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507295
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507296
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 或许，再也看不到了……反而是最好的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507297
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507298
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507299
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 要是我的腋下就已经把你给吓住了的话，那……你还是别去窥探我的内心世界为好。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507300
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507301
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507302
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 你……你在这张照片里看到什么东西了吗？什么，我背后的这个东西？只不过是烟雾罢了，对吧？拜托……告诉我那就是烟雾而已，好吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507303
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 不然，会是什么？不知道从哪里来的灰烬？幽灵？又或者说，也许就是一袋肉而已，对吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507304
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507305
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507306
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 你知道吗？大地……会与我们交谈。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507307
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 来，扣下扳机吧，也许，这样一来我就再也不用听到它的低语了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507308
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507309
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507310
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 我本来觉得，从尸体身上拿取物品是一种罪过。然而……看到他们就这样躺在土中、张开着嘴，里面还金光闪闪……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507311
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 又有谁经得住呢，放着的话，不是暴殄天物吗？反正，死者根本就不会在乎。而生者，则非常需要这些东西。不过，也许……他们会对我怀恨在心就对了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507312
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 一般来说，我都会用铲子来挖掘墓穴。然而，天气变冷、地面结冰的时候，就只能徒手上阵了。即便指甲断裂、指头流血，也还是得继续挖。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507313
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 因为……我根本就不想停下来，也无法停下来。一旦停住，就会听到大地的低语。然后，就永远也忘不了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507314
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 有时，刚刚把一个墓穴给填上……当晚，却能听到土里传来一些轻微的摩擦声。四处张望，却什么也没有。常常会出现这种难以言喻的情况。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507315
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 眼睛火辣辣地疼……并不是因为睡不着的缘故，而是看到了某种东西，还有一股迫使我随时保持警惕的恐惧。因为，我迟早还会再次遇到那个伪人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507316
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 有时，刚刚把一个墓穴给填上……当晚，却能听到土里传来一些轻微的摩擦声。四处张望，却什么也没有。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507317
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 眼睛火辣辣地疼……并不是因为睡不着的缘故，而是看到了某些东西，某些不该看到的东西。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507318
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 我还记得……某个夏天，我拖着一口棺材、顶着烈日工作。汗水不停地往下流，浑身都痒得不行。有个同事还开玩笑说，”感觉我们是要把自己给埋了。“'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507319
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 我想，也许……还真是这样。我把自己一点、一点地埋进了地下，与死者为伴。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507320
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 有时，我总会想……也许，他还在那里。就在我之前挖的那个坑洞里。就是……就是他该在的地方。我记得很清楚，明明是自己亲手埋葬的他……唉，罢了、罢了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507321
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 照相就像是在两个世界之间闪耀的一道亮光，会显现出那些尚未离去的人……以及那些不该留下的人。然而，归根到底，也就是一道光，仅此而已。对吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507322
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 从前，总有人说，照片会偷走人的灵魂。现在，我倒觉得……也许，它们只会偷走比较温暖的那一部分。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507323
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 我既迟钝、又麻木，浑身僵硬。现实中如此，照片中，依旧如此……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507324
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 有时，我会躺在地上、耳贴地面。从那时起……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507325
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 我总是能听到，好像有人在呼唤自己的声音。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507326
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 也许，是我头脑混乱、产生了幻觉。又或者说……你仔细想一想。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507327
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 伪人说不定就藏在下面，正一个接着一个地、陆续爬出来……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507328
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: 好吧……就来看看，死后会有什么东西在等待着我们好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507329
    m_Localized: 'GraveDigger: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507330
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 行啊查吧……别浪费我时间，时间就是金钱。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507331
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507332
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507333
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507334
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507335
    m_Localized: 照片
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507336
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507337
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 看来，你还挺尽责。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507338
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507339
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 好吧……听着，我也曾经风光过。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507340
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 之前，曾经有过这样的一件案子……我们抓到了一个倒霉蛋，指挥官只是看了看他的嘴巴，就认定他是个伪人。接着……就直接掏出枪来，把对方给打死了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507341
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 于是，我就心想……看来，最好还是不要把自己的牙齿清理得太过仔细、太过干净。主要是为了避免引起不必要的怀疑。你应该能理解吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507342
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507343
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507344
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 你想让我脱掉这对手套？绝无可能，一点都不安全。就这样检查吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507345
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507346
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507347
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507348
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507349
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 哎呀……我特别喜欢这项检查。毕竟，人类的双眼非常、非常的美丽。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507350
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507351
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 满是血丝，对吗？要知道，我之前一直戴着面具……因此，多多少少会造成一点影响。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507352
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 视力会下降。还有，视野会变窄。就好像随时都得透过圆孔看东西一样……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507353
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507354
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507355
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 你真的要看？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507356
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507357
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 恶心，对吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507358
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 没有办法，穿着这件制服出汗，就会变成这个样子。皮肤变得干燥、裂开，甚至还会溃烂。不过，也没什么……这还不算是我经历过最糟糕的事情。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507359
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507360
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507361
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 我得事先声明，照片拍出来之后，看起来可能会……不太寻常。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507362
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507363
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 据说，要是长时间与伪人打交道的话……灵光就会变得非常、非常的奇怪。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507364
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507365
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507366
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 开什么玩笑？我们从来都没有接受过这项训练。虽然并不清楚其他小队是什么情况，不过，我们从来都没有检查过别人的耳朵。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507367
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507368
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 一双普普通通、四处可见的耳朵，对吧？你在浪费自己的时间。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507369
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507370
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507371
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 不是，等等，你这是什么意思？我很确定自己的牙齿没有任何问题。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507372
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507373
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507374
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 我的双手完全没有任何问题……难道，你是铁了心的想让我脱掉这对手套？即便这样，我也需要一点时间进行准备……没有办法马上满足你的要求。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507375
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507376
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507377
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 这双眼睛已经看过太多、太多的东西了。或许……也是时候就此闭上了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507378
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507379
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507380
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 我能理解。这幅……光景，可能会把你给吓到。不过，先听我说……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507381
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507382
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507383
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 唉，我早就已经警告过你了。不如……先给自己拍一张照片、看看你的灵光如何，再考虑一下要不要拿枪指着我，好吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507384
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507385
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507386
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 你也知道，自己正在检查错误的地方，对吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507387
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507388
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507389
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 我永远都忘不了当时的情景。我们甚至没有仔细地去检查，结果……嘭的一声，一条人命就这样没了。也许，那个家伙根本就不是伪人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507390
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 现在，为了以防万一……我已经不怎么打理自己的牙齿了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507391
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 每天都穿着这件制服。不光热得难受、汗水不断滴落，双手甚至还散发出了腐烂的味道……而且，还不能脱掉。现在，已经习惯成自然了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507392
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 以致于，一旦脱掉手套，双手就……感觉不属于自己了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507393
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 走进火场之后，最开始，你只想做好自己的工作。然后，突然之间……你发现自己已经再也看不清别人的模样了，只剩一个又一个的轮廓。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507394
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 接着是浓烟，再来是余烬。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507395
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 最后……就只剩下一片虚无。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507396
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 有时，你埋头苦干、相信上头的家伙会关心自己，会挂念你的安全。结果，最后，你发现……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507397
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 根本就没人在乎。想要过上舒适的生活，就得自己去争取、为之奋斗。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507398
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 否则，就得选择和痛苦为伴……与之共存，直至变得习以为常。然后，一直保持这个状态活下去、直到生命的尽头……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507399
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 我很好奇……你为什么会花费这么大的工夫去做这些事情，不仅让人进来，还消耗自己仅剩的精力去检查他们？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507400
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 万一你对某人产生了感情，而对方恰好是个伪人……该怎么办？要杀掉自己在乎的人……实在是太过的痛苦了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507401
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 不能盲信一切。要学会批判思考、辨别真伪。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507402
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 特别是电视里说的东西。毕竟，它可是那群家伙的喉舌……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507403
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 不过，话说回来……我们又能相信谁呢？这个世界，为何如此复杂？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507404
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 要是有谁能把这所有的一切都变得简单的话，恐怕……会被大众尊为圣人吧。哈哈……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507405
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 等等，你、你不能这样！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507406
    m_Localized: 'FormerFema: 我、我可是FEMA的工作人员！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507407
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 好吧……就来看看一夜之间会有什么变化好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507408
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507409
    m_Localized: 双手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507410
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507411
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507412
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507413
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507414
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 好的，稍等一下。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507415
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 由于实在太困，我经常会忘掉一些事情。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507416
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507417
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 有些事情，就是得要轻松一点去面对。这样一来，这所有的一切都会变得稍微正常一点。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507418
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 由于实在太困，我经常会忘掉一些事情。不过，我还是有在打理自己的牙齿。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507419
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507420
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 有时，就是得要好好打理好自己。这样一来，这所有的一切都会变得稍微正常一点。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507421
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 我很好奇，不知，能否透过梦来辨别谁是人类、谁是伪人？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507422
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507423
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507424
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 为了达成目标，我们已经准备好突破任何障碍、克服任何困难了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507425
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 也许，我正一点、一点地爬进自己的梦中？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507426
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507427
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 我到底是在跟谁进行斗争？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507428
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 我得……重新做梦才行，难道，不是吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507429
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507430
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507431
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 我记得曾在某处听说过，失眠会让眼睛变得暗沉。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507432
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 不知道是不是真的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507433
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507434
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 看来……的确如此，之前要更明亮一些。现在？简直红得不行。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507435
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 顺带一提，我已经有……这么说吧，非常长的一段时间没睡过觉了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507436
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 因此，要是没有遍布血丝的话、反而比较奇怪，对吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507437
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507438
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507439
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 不知道为什么，总感觉有点疼，就好像是过敏了一样。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507440
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507441
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 如何？状况……不太好吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507442
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507443
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507444
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 我很好奇拍出来的照片会长什么样子。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507445
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507446
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 哎呀，看来，并不普通，据说有灵光缠绕？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507447
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 然而，怎么感觉……空荡荡的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507448
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 你确定这真的管用吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507449
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 归根到底……所谓的灵光，真的存在吗？你见到过吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507450
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 梦是真实存在的。起码，之前确实如此。至于，这个东西……实在是有点……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507451
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507452
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507453
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 蛤？我完全没听说过，还有这样的事情。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507454
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 好啊，来试试吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507455
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507456
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 好啦……得出判决了吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507457
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 归根到底，你知道自己要找什么东西吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507458
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507459
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507460
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 你也知道，我已经很久没有睡过觉了。现在，根本就分不清这一切究竟是梦境、抑或是现实。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507461
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 这样就说得通了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507462
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507463
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507464
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 真是有趣。要是大家还会做梦的话，不知……我能不能逃进某人的梦中呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507465
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507466
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507467
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 我一直在寻找一个可以让我入睡的地方。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507468
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 我感觉自己浑身无力，然而……眼睛却变得越来越警觉。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507469
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 不对，等等，我具备的特征真的和电视上说的一样、与伪人无异吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507470
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 既然如此，你为什么还这么疑神疑鬼？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507471
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 难以理解。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507472
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507473
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507474
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 真假？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507475
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 我的身体因为缺乏睡眠而变得日渐干枯，你的身体……难道不也是这样吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507476
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507477
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507478
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 对此，我有几个问题。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507479
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507480
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507481
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 你能把这副身体全都打穿吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507482
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 这样的话，即便我醒了、也没有办法再回到里面去了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507483
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 只要把它留在这里，就好。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507484
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 我会在死亡的领域之中待上一段时间。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507485
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 即便没了肉体，我也能撑下去。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507486
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507487
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507488
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 非要说的话……伪人的牙齿应该是脏兮兮的，这样反而要更加合理，对吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507489
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 譬如……他们是从地下爬出来的，对吧？为了破土而出，就连牙齿也一并用上、给自己挖出一条通道，这样推测比较自然。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507490
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 为何你会认为我的指甲很脏？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507491
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 我只不过是想尽己所能、闯进梦中罢了，仅此而已。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507492
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 要是能成功的话，我就不会再伤害自己了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507493
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 因为，就再也没有意义了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507494
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 不是……你仔细思考一下。如今这个世道，眼睛怎么可能会不变得暗淡、无光？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507495
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 怎么可能会不因为长时间的紧绷而变得干涩、疲惫？搞不好都已经呆滞了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507496
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 不是……你仔细思考一下。如今这个世道，眼睛怎么可能会不变得红肿不堪、布满血丝？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507497
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 怎么可能会不因长时间的紧绷而变得干涩、疲惫？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507498
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 而我，甚至已经很久没有睡过觉、做过梦了。逻辑上完全说得通，不是吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507499
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 大家……难道都不是这样的？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507500
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 要是长时间不睡觉的话，就会开始感到一股寒意……紧接着，又会觉得无比干燥。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507501
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 随着时间的流逝，还会发展出某种热病。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507502
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 而且，状况只会变得越来越严重。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507503
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 你是在哪里听说这项特征的？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507504
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 从电视上？真是奇怪。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507505
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 我……我难以理解。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507506
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 其他的都好说，唯独这个……灵光？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507507
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 实在是把我给吓得不轻。没想到现在竟然有这么多人精神错乱，毫无缘由地纠结于这种所谓的超自然现象。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507508
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 要知道，我们甚至就连自然规律都还没完全搞懂呢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507509
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 真的是非常、非常有意思的报道，介于睡眠与现实之间。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507510
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 你确定自己真的看过吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507511
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 也许，只是一场梦而已？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507512
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 虽然……我也能理解就是了。真是一种奇怪的感觉。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507513
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 你竟然会出于一些莫名其妙、不知真假的原因而痛下杀手，真是……有趣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507514
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 虽然，非要说的话，更令人感到毛骨悚然就是了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507515
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 没有了梦，大家都失去了理智。我会死去。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507516
    m_Localized: 'Intruder: 抑或沉睡。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507517
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: 死亡会用她冰冷的怀抱温暖我们。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507518
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507519
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507520
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507521
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507522
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507523
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507524
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507525
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507526
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
