    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507561
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: 说话做事之前要三思。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507562
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507563
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507564
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507565
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507566
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507567
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: 不值得你掏枪。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507568
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507569
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507570
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507571
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507572
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507573
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: 你说……你为什么要费心做检查？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507574
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: 只要做好上路的准备，等着时辰到的那一天就好。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507575
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: 我不知道你在等待什么。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507576
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: 我没什么可说的了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507577
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507578
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507579
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: 我的形象，已经很久没有留下能让人永恒铭记的片段了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507580
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507581
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: 你犯下了可悲的错误。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507582
    m_Localized: 'Cultist1: 你会为自己的行为付出代价。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507583
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 没什么好怕的，我们都会启程前往更美好的国度，寻到救赎。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507584
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507585
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507586
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507587
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507588
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507589
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507590
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 没问题。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507591
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 像灵魂一样扭曲……大得不合常理。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507592
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507593
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507594
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507595
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507596
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507597
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507598
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: ……每个人都有自己的苦难要承受。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507599
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507600
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507601
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 我们无法入睡。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507602
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507603
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 她必然会到来，但据说睡眠会让她来得更快。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507604
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507605
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507606
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507607
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507608
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507609
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507610
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507611
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 照片……？新鲜东西。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507612
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 我有点……不安。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507613
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507614
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 有意思……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507615
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507616
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507617
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507618
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507619
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507620
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507621
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507622
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 比我想的……还要让人不安。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507623
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507624
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507625
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 为时……尚早……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507626
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507627
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507628
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 我……我还没准备好上路。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507629
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507630
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507631
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 啊……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507632
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507633
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507634
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 啊，尝试新事物总有风险。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507635
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507636
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507637
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: ……时候还没到。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507638
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 别开枪。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507639
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507640
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507641
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 谢谢你。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507642
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 他们说，等她到来，所有苦难都会结束。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507643
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 希望是真的……我受的苦够多了，该休息了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507644
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 他们说，尘世之外有永恒的安宁。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507645
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 你的终结正步步逼近，你有没有明白死亡的恐怖？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507646
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 腋下不过是身体上一处凹陷，你这样让我觉得……好丢人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507647
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 我说出“腋下”这个词都觉得怪怪的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507648
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 噢，不是普通的照片。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507649
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 不知道是什么东西，但是……挺好看的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507650
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 谢谢你，朋友。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507651
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 识别异乡人的办法那么多……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507652
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: ……可还是有那么多异乡人在为非作歹。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507653
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: 一切都很好……我很安全。我……我要开启更美好的人生了……一、一切都很好……没有什么好怕的……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507654
    m_Localized: 'Cultist2: ……靠！我、我还不想死，！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507655
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 想看就看吧。但是，不要妨碍我们。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507656
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507657
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507658
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507659
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507660
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507661
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507662
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 上颚和下颚差别这么大，真有意思。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507663
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507664
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507665
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507666
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507667
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 指甲缝不干净，看着就像是异乡人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507668
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507669
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 异乡人会召唤死亡，而死亡会拯救我们。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507670
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507671
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507672
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 眼睛快看不见东西了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507673
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507674
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 我说不定会比同袍先上路。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507675
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507676
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507677
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507678
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931045507679
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701376
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701377
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701378
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 稍等一下，我挽一挽袍子。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701379
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701380
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
