    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701384
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701385
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701386
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701387
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701388
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 我再说一次，不要妨碍我们。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701389
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701390
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701391
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 你脑子不清醒了。同袍，快把枪放下。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701392
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701393
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701394
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 不要妄自阻挠。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701395
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701396
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701397
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701398
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701399
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701400
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 你觉得我应该比命中注定的更早迎来终结么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701401
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701402
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701403
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701404
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701405
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701406
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 能看的你都看了。我得去做准备了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701407
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 每个人都有自己的任务。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701408
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701409
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701410
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 保留影像没有用。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701411
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 所有必须之物，都会留存在记忆中。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701412
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701413
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 同袍，何等愚昧啊。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701414
    m_Localized: 'Cultist3: 他们会将你烧成灰烬，死亡也会移开目光。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701415
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 你感觉到了么，宝贝儿？你害怕我不是人类对不对？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701416
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701417
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701418
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701419
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701420
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701421
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701422
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 喜欢么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701423
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701424
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 为何露出这种表情？难道，你曾经见到过跟这一样的牙齿？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701425
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 该不会……我令你想起什么人了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701426
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701427
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701428
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 据说，没有什么要比与心爱之人十指相扣的那一刻更加美妙。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701429
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701430
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 你能摸到我的脉搏。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701431
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 好了……手心出汗，这又意味着什么呢？你紧张了？又或者说，你被某种情绪感染了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701432
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 难不成，是无处可泄的愤怒？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701433
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701434
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701435
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 眼睛会出卖一个人的真实想法。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701436
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701437
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 猜猜看吧，此时、此刻，我的心里到底在想着些什么呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701438
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701439
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701440
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 当然。随意查看就好，我也不会拒绝。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701441
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 我们的身体……会回报关怀，也会记住温情。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701442
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 我很高兴，你我都清楚这一点。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701443
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701444
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701445
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 抱歉，只是……拍照会令我感到疲惫。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701446
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 尽量速战速决，好吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701447
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701448
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 你打算怎么处理这张照片呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701449
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701450
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701451
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 难道……这是你的性癖？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701452
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 没事，我并不介意。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701453
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701454
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 不过，为何偏偏对耳朵情有独钟呢？具体来说，你到底喜欢它们的什么地方？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701455
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701456
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701457
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 难道，你在我的身上……看到了曾经伤害过你的那个人？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701458
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 要是这样的话，为何拿我，一个刚认识不久的人出气？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701459
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701460
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701461
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 看来，的确是愤怒。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701462
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 说说看吧，你在我的身上看到了谁的影子？你究竟要对什么人进行报复？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701463
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701464
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701465
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 令我感到害怕的是，你的眼里没有一丝、一毫的迟疑。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701466
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 你执着于某种特别……死板的行为模式。然而，作为人类，我们会心怀疑问、我们会犹豫不决、我们会寻求解答。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701467
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 你执着于某种特别……死板的行为模式。这是，你自己设定的规矩吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701468
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701469
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701470
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 难道，你害怕美丽的事物？因为……它们难以捉摸？或者，是出于别的理由？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701471
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 难道，你认为长得美的人都很危险？然而，我又能对你造成什么伤害呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701472
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701473
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701474
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 我……在你身上感到了一股由于施虐而带来的快感。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701475
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 太浪漫了，竟然会给将要死于自己手下的人拍照。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701476
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 我很好奇。我……应该已经不是第一个落得如此下场的人了吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701477
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701478
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701479
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 抱歉……我没听清。怎么了吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701480
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701481
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701482
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 最好还是放下那些曾给你带来伤痛的回忆吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701483
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 每当看到些、想到些什么，都会令自己感到撕心、裂肺，完全没有半点意义。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701484
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 照着我说的去做吧。虽然不会立即见效，不过……随着时间的流逝，你会感到轻松一些。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701485
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 我知道，你想保护自己，坚守你的界限。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701486
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 只是，希望你也能够对我表现出同等的尊重。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701487
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 不要把你的过去投射到我的身上。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701488
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 说来也是有趣……如今，大家都不敢直视彼此的双眼。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701489
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 一些人会移开自己的视线，一些人光顾着去寻求解答……一些人只在乎找出对方是否具备伪人的特征。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701490
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 一些人会移开自己的视线……一些人只在乎找出对方是否具备伪人的特征。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701491
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 而你……目光非常坚定。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701492
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 真是有趣。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701493
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 我很清楚……你为自己、为别人感到担忧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701494
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 一想到自己有可能会导致他人死亡，就不由得害怕了起来。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701495
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 不过，你猜怎么样？被人拿枪指着，因此感到受伤，这也是人之常情。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701496
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 我认为你具备一项非常独到的特质，不知道还有没有更好的词可以形容……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701497
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 比起本人，你更喜欢与对方一起共度的回忆。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701498
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 我敢打赌，你肯定保存着大量的照片。然而，你却会习惯性地与他人保持距离。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701499
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 嗯……罢了，还是忘掉吧。抱歉，希望你不要介意。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701500
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 的确。如今这个世道，难以分辨到底哪句是真话、哪句是假话。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701501
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 不过……还是得靠自己去判断真伪。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701502
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 你太过害怕改变，甚至不惜将所有人都拒于千里之外。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701503
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: 不管是陌生人，还是你的家人、爱人，无一例外。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41582931049701504
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: ……你到底会变成什么样子呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722172313600
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722172313601
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722172313602
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722172313603
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722172313604
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722172313605
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722172313606
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722172313607
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090816
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090817
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090818
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090819
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090820
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 欸哟，瞧你拿着散弹枪那样子！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090821
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 想开枪就开呗，你个疯子！不过我告诉你，什么伪人特征，都是胡扯！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090822
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090823
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090824
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 我的天哪……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090825
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 我猜猜，我手指甲这么干净，那肯定是我长得太高，吓到了你，对吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090826
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 吓出毛病来了，就想让别人也信你那套狗屁玩意儿呗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090827
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 带上你那堆狗屁玩意儿滚蛋。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090828
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090829
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090830
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 你是怎么想出这个办法来的，大聪明？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090831
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 我牙齿没问题，手也没问题，你就说眼睛也得检查？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090832
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 不喜欢我就直说，我自己会走。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090833
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090834
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090835
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 你想让我张开嘴巴还是怎么样？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090836
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 以为我这样也能忍得下去？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090837
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090838
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090839
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 说真的，'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090840
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 屋里发生的事你没看见吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090841
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 你信那堆狗屁信得脑子都没了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090842
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 杀人就跟吃饭喝水似的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090843
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 停下来好好想想吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090844
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090845
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090846
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 那些个破新闻……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090847
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 还有这个国家……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090848
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 他们就是这么“照顾”我们的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090849
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 真完蛋……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090850
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090851
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090852
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 去死吧你。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090853
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 老子受够你那副咄咄逼人的嘴脸了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090854
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 你以为我喜欢长这么高？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090855
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 脑袋不是撞到这个就是撞到那个……连坐公交都麻烦！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090856
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 不过嘛……也有好处。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090857
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 我有次看见有人让卡车撞了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090858
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 那辆车没加速往前冲。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090859
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 堵车了，卡车夹在车流里慢慢开，那个人从车前面走过去。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090860
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 那倒霉蛋也真是可怜，正好站在司机视线盲区。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090861
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 卡车就这么慢慢开了过去……碾啊碾……把他碾得比原来还要扁。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090862
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 那场面太吓人了我跟你说。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090863
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: ……长得高，起码不会死得这么蠢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090864
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 靠……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090865
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 你去没去过酒吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090866
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 伪人冒出来之前，那儿有一大堆符合伪人特征的人：红眼睛，指甲缝脏兮兮的，牙齿又白又亮！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090867
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 然后呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090868
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 然后其中有些人死了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090869
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 不过重点不是这个，重点是你要跑到酒吧里来这套，说要检查别人，你知道会怎么样么？人家会一脚把你踹出去。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090870
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090871
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 我不知道你怎么能随便拿枪指人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090872
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 疯了吧你。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090873
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 疯了吧你。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090874
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 能不能滚蛋？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090875
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090876
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 你想让我说什么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090877
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 谢谢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090878
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 不管去到哪儿，碰见的不是哭个没完的人，就是没法说理的疯子。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090879
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 世界乱成这样，人究竟怎么样才能保持清醒……？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090880
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 好吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722189090881
    m_Localized: 'Esenin: 妈的……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285120
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285121
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285122
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 我认输了！哈哈！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285123
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 算你赢了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285124
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: ……可我都不知道我们在玩的是什么游戏！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285125
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285126
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285127
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 噢对！爸爸以前跟我说过这么个游戏！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285128
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 就是，嗯……玩的人分成两边。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285129
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 一边藏宝藏，再画个圈圈当牢房，抓到另一边的人就关进牢房里！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285130
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 另一边的人要边找宝藏边逃跑，不让藏宝藏的人抓到！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285131
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 两边的人都要带武器！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285132
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 不过爸爸说他们带的武器就是根木棍子。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285133
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: ……噢！想起来了！游戏叫“警察抓小偷”！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285134
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 你小时候也玩过吗？是不是想跟我一起再玩一次？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285135
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 啊……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285136
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 但是我还没藏好宝藏！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285137
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285138
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 我也没有什么好东西可以藏……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285139
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285140
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285141
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285142
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 我不喜欢这个游戏……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285143
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 太吓人了……能不能玩点儿别的？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285144
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 求你了……！指甲也好其他地方也罢，你要看我都给你看了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285145
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285146
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285147
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 我好喜欢妈妈的指甲。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285148
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 不过，唔，我想不起来她指甲长什么样了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285149
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 就记得超~级漂亮。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285150
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 她还有条超~级好看的裙子！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285151
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 跟我穿的一样好看！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285152
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 爸爸说我长得跟妈妈一样漂亮！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285153
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: ……爸爸。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285154
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 我、我没事……我、我没哭……我是大姑娘了……不哭哭的……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285155
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285156
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285157
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285158
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 我……我不要！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285159
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 我……我……我会死翘翘的！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285160
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285161
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285162
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285163
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 我有次去了个离家超级远的游乐场！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285164
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 那儿的滑滑梯是我见过的最大的！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285165
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 超~~~级大！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285166
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 不过我当时一点也不害怕！滑滑梯多好玩呀！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285167
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 我滑了好多好多次，口渴得要命，能喝得下一整个湖的水！不对，是一整个大洋！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285168
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 但是爸爸走丢了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285169
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 我就害怕起来了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285170
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 游乐场离家太远了，没有爸爸，我一个人不知道怎么回去！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285171
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: ……不过爸爸后面回来找我了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285172
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 说不定，他这次也是走丢了呢？希望他能快点回来找我。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285173
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285174
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285175
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 我在动画片里看见过！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285176
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 有条狗拿枪指着人，砰一下，给人拍了张照！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285177
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 唔，你的枪是不是也是拍照用的？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722193285178
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479424
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479425
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: ……我猜不是。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479426
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 我想起来了！还有件事！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479427
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 我跟爸爸去逛超市。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479428
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 有人拿枪指着我们。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479429
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 那个人一头长发，穿了件长外套。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479430
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 爸爸吓了一跳，不过立马就跟那个人抱在了一起。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479431
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479432
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 说不定这件事是我梦到的？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479433
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 我……我不、不记得了，我……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479434
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479435
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479436
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 啊……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479437
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 能不能也给我看看你的耳朵？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479438
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 还是说，你是故意要欺负我？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479439
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 你有时候跟我好朋友一样……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479440
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479441
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479442
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 我跟我朋友一起玩……啦啦啦！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479443
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 然后……她忽然就欺负我一下！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479444
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 不过我知道，她是个好人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479445
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 她不喜欢自己家，她妈妈管她管得超~~~级严。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479446
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 这个不让做，那个不让做。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479447
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 她妈妈没准是个伪人？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479448
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 爸爸也管我管得很严，不过也有放松的时候！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479449
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 等爸爸来接我了，我应该去看看她……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479450
    m_Localized: 'Daughter: 爸爸……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722197479451
    m_Localized: 妈妈……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722210062336
    m_Localized: 'FatalDame: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722210062337
    m_Localized: 我要检查一下我自己
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722210062338
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722210062339
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722210062340
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722210062341
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450944
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450945
    m_Localized: 很干净
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450946
    m_Localized: ……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450947
    m_Localized: ……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450948
    m_Localized: 靠，雪白……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450949
    m_Localized: 老烟枪见了要眼红。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450950
    m_Localized: 焦黄……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450951
    m_Localized: 这样更好。至少没人会把我错认成伪人。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450952
    m_Localized: ……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450953
    m_Localized: ……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450954
    m_Localized: 指甲缝都是泥……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450955
    m_Localized: 没完没了刨土搞的。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450956
    m_Localized: 双手干净……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450957
    m_Localized: 沾了点火药渣。不碍事。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450958
    m_Localized: ……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450959
    m_Localized: ……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450960
    m_Localized: 通红……真该死。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450961
    m_Localized: 就不该灌那么多提神玩意儿。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450962
    m_Localized: 眼睛没问题。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450963
    m_Localized: 没血丝。抓不到把柄。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450964
    m_Localized: ……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450965
    m_Localized: ……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450966
    m_Localized: 全是毛。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450967
    m_Localized: 正常得很。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450968
    m_Localized: 操！这他妈是什么？！
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450969
    m_Localized: 像是皮疹……也可能更糟糕，搞不好是真菌。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450970
    m_Localized: ……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450971
    m_Localized: 得清理一下。说不定清理了就没事了。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450972
    m_Localized: ……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450973
    m_Localized: ……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450974
    m_Localized: 耳朵看着……没事。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450975
    m_Localized: ……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450976
    m_Localized: 刚才那份检测报告到底算什么玩意儿？
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43886722218450977
    m_Localized: ……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577463595008
    m_Localized: 'Anger: 我……偶尔会非常用力地咬紧牙关，甚至能听到下颚在咯咯地作响。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577476177920
    m_Localized: 'Anger: 这该死的毛病快要把我给逼疯了……每当我反应过来的时候，都已经太晚了，每次都是这样。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577501343744
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 我的姊妹……为什么会这样？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577501343745
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577501343746
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 现在，一切均已失去意义……就连尝试也是枉费心机……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577501343747
    m_Localized: 'Alkonost: 开枪吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577505538048
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 死亡带走了我的姊妹……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577505538049
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 没有了地，我……我该怎么活下去？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577505538050
    m_Localized: 'Sirin: 来吧，我已经准备好了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315264
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 我就知道你会这么说。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315265
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315266
    m_Localized: 双手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315267
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315268
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315269
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315270
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315271
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 好吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315272
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315273
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: ……过去的几周里，一直都没有什么机会好好地洗漱一下。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315274
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 逃过一劫。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315275
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315276
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315277
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 双手，真假？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315278
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315279
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 抱歉，最近一直都在挖些脏得不行的东西。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315280
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315281
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315282
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 我已经连续好几天没睡过觉了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315283
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315284
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 女儿不见了，怎么睡得着。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315285
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315286
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315287
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 已经不知道该检查什么地方好了，是吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315288
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315289
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315290
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315291
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315292
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 千万、千万不要让FEMA的家伙看到拍出来的照片。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315293
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315294
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: ……你有听说过吸血鬼的故事吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315295
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 据说，它们不会出现在照片里、它们会在晚上出去觅食，而且……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315296
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 它们是不朽之物。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315297
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315298
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315299
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 你不觉得这些检查实在是有些荒唐吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315300
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315301
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 热知识，耳朵里有污垢？再正常不过了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315302
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315303
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315304
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 没有比这还要细的牙签了，是吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315305
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 想要开枪？随你的便。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315306
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 只是……我还以为你是个会认真听别人说话的家伙呢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315307
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315308
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315309
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 小心一点。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315310
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 虽说我是不朽之人，不过……一旦扣下扳机，'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315311
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 我就再也无法与你交谈了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315312
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315313
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315314
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 如果你认为我是伪人，只能说，大错特错。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315315
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 我是不朽之人，你杀不死我的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315316
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315317
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315318
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 你疯了不成？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315319
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 一旦扣下扳机，你就再也无法得知伪人的秘密了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315320
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315321
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315322
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 希望里面装的是纯银。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315323
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 否则，只会浪费子弹……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315324
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 还有我的耐心。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315325
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315326
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315327
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 来吧。要是你对官方的那套说辞深信不疑的话，就尽管扣下扳机好了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315328
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 只是，我可不会对此默不作声。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315329
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 记好，我一定会回来，把你的脖子给扭断。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315330
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315331
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315332
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 要是我的牙齿真的令你感到如此烦恼的话……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315333
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 我会找时间好好地清理一下的……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315334
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 拿手指来代替牙刷。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315335
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 我也清楚，看起来并不怎么赏心悦目。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315336
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 毕竟，一整天都在这里挖来、挖去……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315337
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 无论是谁，都不可避免地会把自己的双手给弄脏。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315338
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 不要盲信电视里报导出来的东西。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315339
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 如今这个世道，能不把双手给弄脏反而是个奇迹。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315340
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 要不是已经好几天都没怎么睡过觉的话，我一定会好好地直视你的双眼。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315341
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 独自穿过大半座城市……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315342
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 白天要回避太阳，晚上得躲着FEMA、以及伪人……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315343
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 我根本就连合上眼睛的时间都没有。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315344
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 腋下，是吧？还真敢说。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315345
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 看来，FEMA已经彻底乱成一团了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315346
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 说不定，他们现在正一边舔着伪人的卵蛋、一边寻找着新的特征呢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315347
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 也好，我不介意亲自给他们尝尝我这对“宝贝”是什么滋味。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315348
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 千万不要再拿枪指着我了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315349
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 否则……对你而言，情况只会变得更糟。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315350
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 如果还是不听劝告，执意表现出这种没有一丝、一毫尊重的态度……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315351
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 就不要怪我扭断你的脖子。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315352
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 但愿你对应急中心那帮人也这么硬气。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315353
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 他们可不像伪人还装人样……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315354
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 从骨子里就是群杂碎。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315355
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 省点子弹吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315356
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 收拾他们耗的弹药绝对比打伪人多。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315357
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 蠢货……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315358
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 还以为你比他们聪明点……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315359
    m_Localized: 'Jacob: 早料到会死在蠢货手里……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48219577522315360
    m_Localized: 去他妈的……
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58333830346432512
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58333830346432513
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58333830400958464
    m_Localized: 清理
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535808
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 行，我先喝完这罐劲能佳……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535809
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535810
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535811
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535812
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535813
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535814
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535815
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 我有没有跟你说过，我不喝劲能佳，嘴里也会有劲能佳的味道？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535816
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 这玩意儿是用什么吓人的化学物质做的吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535817
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 不过谁在乎呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535818
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535819
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 靠，舌头变色了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535820
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 靠，牙坏了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535821
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535822
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535823
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 好——嘞，看手是吧，来。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535824
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 手最近挺痒的，跟有蚂蚁爬一样……哈。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535825
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 我最近没乱抓什么东西，应该没问题。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535826
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535827
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 唔，不知道为什么，看着有点儿扭曲。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535828
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 可能是摄入太多咖啡因了吧，手老抖个不停。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535829
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 让我歇上十分钟左右，应该就能符合检查标准了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535830
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535831
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535832
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 我看过新闻，说眼睛应该是有点儿暗，有点儿浑浊的那种绿色。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535833
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 千万别搞混了。如今这世道，绿色也有很多种。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535834
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535835
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 等等，怎么了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535836
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 红色的？伪人的眼睛是红的？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535837
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 那电视里干嘛说是绿的？我的眼睛到底是什么颜色？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535838
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 那电视里干嘛说是绿的？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535839
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535840
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535841
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 哎，唯一一个说得过去的特征。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535842
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535843
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 没变色，一点也不脏，没什么不对劲的地方。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535844
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 就。是。个。普。普。通。通。的。腋。窝。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535845
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 很好。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535846
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535847
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535848
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 我只在派对上拍过照。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535849
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 现在好像没人开什么派对了，不然就是开了但没请我去玩，哈。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535850
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535851
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 我的心跳得特别快。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535852
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 灌再多劲能佳都没用。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535853
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535854
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535855
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 好，没问题。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535856
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535857
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 我是不是该先清理清理？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535858
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 还是说就这样就行？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535859
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535860
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535861
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 哇哦。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535862
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 我还以为你不是那种看见什么都开枪的人。这种人已经够多了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535863
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 说实话，我以为在你这儿能暂时躲开暴力。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535864
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535865
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535866
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 怎么这时候掏枪出来了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535867
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 你应该没打算开枪吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535868
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 除非官方说眼睛抽搐算是新特征。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535869
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535870
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535871
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 不对。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535872
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 眼睛发红是伪人这是你自己说的。还是说……我眼睛变红了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535873
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 你到底要怎么样，直说行不行，我真的懵了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535874
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535875
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535876
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 你这实在是不怎么样。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535877
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535878
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535879
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 等等，我的心脏没什么大问题，不用开洞手术。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535880
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 就是跳得特别快而已，明白吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535881
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 等会儿，你先让我喘口气。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535882
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535883
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535884
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 起码先告诉我为什么吧！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535885
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535886
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535887
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 我明白，就是为了安全，还有做好预防措施之类的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535888
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 不过你这么说开枪就开枪，这儿很快就得乱起来。看谁觉得不对劲，抬手就一枪。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535889
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 你说不定也该离开这儿，去哪个很远很远的地方转转，找找属于你的安宁。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535890
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 总比你随便开枪杀人要简单。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535891
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 你知道最吓人的是什么吗？就是手都抬不起来，想堵枪口都堵不了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535892
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 是，我知道堵枪口挺蠢的，可面对子弹，谁不会想起码伸手堵一下枪口试试？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535893
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 等会儿……不是什么都会带点儿绿？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535894
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 那……万物到底是什么颜色的？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535895
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 世界是什么时候变成绿色的，我都没发觉……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535896
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 哇，我都糊涂了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535897
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 整天掏枪吓唬人，不会让人有安全感，你知道吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535898
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 你随便威胁人，伪人也不会说不杀人就不杀人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535899
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 最后最可怕的不是伪人，是你自己。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535900
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 你这么做真的值得吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535901
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 恐吓别人没意义。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535902
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 你……哈啊……你只会让所有人跟你反目成仇。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535903
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 天呐，让我喘口气……我心脏受不了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535904
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 反正……别拿枪指人了……行吗？屁用没有……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535905
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 我……我这就走……哈啊……哈啊……不会再吓到你了，行吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535906
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 就这么……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535907
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 说完就完了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535908
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 摇滚起来吧，说不定还来得及撼动这个世界！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535909
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535910
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535911
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535912
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535913
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535914
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535915
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 哎——烟抽多了，牙都黄了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535916
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 好笑吧，哈……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535917
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535918
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 一起玩乐队的人给我留下的只有回忆和牙垢了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535919
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535920
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535921
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 有个刺青。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535922
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535923
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 那天晚上太刺激了。刺青师喝得烂醉，我也没好到哪儿去，不然也没胆子找他给我刺青。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535924
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 等会儿……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535925
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 没准儿不是刺青。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535926
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 记不清了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535927
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535928
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535929
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 我们以前觉得往眼球里注射墨水很拉风。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535930
    m_Localized: 'Unstable: 我脑子里还是会闪过那段刺激的经历。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535931
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535932
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 不是往我眼睛里注射。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535933
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 有人注射完墨水，眼睛瞎了。不过说真的，你真该看看他那双眼睛。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535934
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 能有双那样的眼睛，我死也甘愿……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535935
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535936
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535937
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 请便。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535938
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535939
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 看见什么有问题的地方了么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535940
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535941
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535942
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 来，合个影！我没准儿还会在上面签个名呢！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535943
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535944
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 哇。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535945
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 下回拍照记得先摘镜头盖。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535946
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535947
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535948
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 我以前喜欢扯耳朵，后来……扯烦了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599660535949
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924416
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 扯多了，有点变形。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924417
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 不过我觉得还可以吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924418
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924419
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924420
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 你来真的？算了，想开就开吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924421
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924422
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924423
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 没什么好害怕的了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924424
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924425
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924426
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 冷静点儿，没必要拿着枪乱挥。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924427
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924428
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924429
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 我不想让身上有股味道，因为这个你就要开枪杀我？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924430
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 也太荒唐了吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924431
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924432
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924433
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 哎，你是摘了镜头盖拍的是吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924434
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924435
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924436
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 看来你不喜欢我的耳朵。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924437
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924438
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924439
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 没准儿那段丰富又完美的即兴重复段还在什么地方等着我。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924440
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 我没什么想法，脑子里只有低沉的嗡嗡声。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924441
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 不过说实话，对我来说，你开不开枪有区别么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924442
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 反正我这辈子都不可能上台演出。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924443
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 我现在真想上台痛快弹一场，收获台下一片掌声。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924444
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 太可惜了，你这儿最烈的就是啤酒了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924445
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 我真想大醉一场。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924446
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 都不知道该说什么好。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924447
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 呃，谢谢你检查我腋下？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924448
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 不过这张照片怎么这么暗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924449
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 我们以前练习的地方都比这张照片亮。你拍的时候不是开了灯么。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924450
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 那什么，我从没想过在我们的歌里加教堂的铃声。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924451
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 不过我现在觉得，加点儿说不定也不错。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924452
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 我们的歌……哈，好像还有谁能跟我一起演出似的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924453
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 那什么……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924454
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 没准儿这是我这辈子最棒的一场演出。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924455
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 没准儿他们在上面等我。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924456
    m_Localized: 'Rocker: 摇滚起来，嗨翻世界！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924457
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 好吧。想看什么地方，说一声就成。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924458
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924459
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924460
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924461
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924462
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924463
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924464
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 牙齿啊？都黄了。不是蛀牙就是差不多的问题吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924465
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 牢里可不发薄荷味牙刷。牙龈出血别大惊小怪的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924466
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924467
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 这不算什么特征吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924468
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924469
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924470
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 没问题。看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924471
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924472
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 看见没？正常得很。就是……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924473
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 手上有点儿东西。别紧张，就是热疹子。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924474
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 这双手？当年可没少“活动”……不过我也因为这个蹲够大牢了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924475
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924476
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924477
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 想看看我有没有良心吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924478
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924479
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 行吧，那你看清楚。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924480
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924481
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 我原以为墨镜能挡太阳。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924482
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 结果反而更糟。屁用没有，真的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924483
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 屁用没有。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924484
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924485
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924486
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 那什么……我会给你看，但是……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924487
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924488
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 以前喝醉酒瞎折腾，烧伤过，你别吓到。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924489
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924490
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 行了。怎么样，我不是那种怪胎吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924491
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924492
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924493
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 你这是想给我备案吗？拍大头照算怎么回事？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924494
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: ……还是说这是什么测试？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924495
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924496
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 感觉又回到被登记入册的时候了。照片塞进档案里那套流程。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924497
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 行吧，要拍就拍。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924498
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924499
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 拍完了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924500
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924501
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924502
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 什么鬼？现在轮到耳朵了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924503
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 你疯了吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924504
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 你真要看这个？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924505
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924506
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 行吧，去他妈的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924507
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924508
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 怎么样？发现里面有什么不对劲吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924509
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924510
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924511
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 你确定自己脑子没坏掉？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924512
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 牙齿是黄的，为什么还要掏枪？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924513
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 还是你打算用牙龈出血当借口把我崩了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924514
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924515
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924516
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 你他妈掏枪干什么？收起来。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924517
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924518
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924519
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 你觉得我在骗你？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924520
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 我告诉你，墨镜挡不住太阳。你自己试试就知道了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924521
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924522
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924523
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 我懂，看我腋窝是不怎么雅观……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924524
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 但至于这样吗？咱们刚才不还聊得好好的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924525
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924526
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924527
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 伙计，你把我跟别的什么混蛋搞混了吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924528
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 我犯了事，蹲了牢——刚放出来没多久。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924529
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924530
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924531
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 你认真的吗？这也太过了吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924532
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 牙齿和身上脏我能理解。但耳朵算什么特征？压根没人提过耳朵的事儿。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924533
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924534
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924535
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 很好。别动不动就掏枪。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924536
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 手指头一痒，那就全完了。彻底玩儿完。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924537
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 我知道你不是那种废话连篇的人，但是……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924538
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 但也别什么事都拿枪顶着人家脑袋，明白吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924539
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 我在牢里管事的那儿受够这套了，真的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924540
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 这是你的地盘，我也不多嘴。但别搞得像个暴君似的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924541
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 你又不是街区老大，要把人榨干，对吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924542
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 省省你的子弹吧，伙计。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924543
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 相信我，我是真货，可以跟你拍胸脯保证！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924544
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 我什么都偷了，就是没偷人类的身份！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924545
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 你脑子进水了吗？为了一张破照片就要干掉我？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924546
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 妈的，牢里管事的都没这么折腾过我……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924547
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 哈，看吧，你总算恢复理智了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924548
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 刚才我还以为你真要因为电视上都没提过的屁事把我给毙了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924549
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 操，你真是个蠢货。我还以为你是个靠得住的人，结果你是个祸害！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924550
    m_Localized: 'Experienced: 你的枪管迟早会害死你！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924551
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 天呐……我要真是伪人，别告诉我。直接开枪。好吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924552
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924553
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924554
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924555
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924556
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924557
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924558
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 好，看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924559
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924560
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 我有龅牙凸得比较严重，有时会不小心咬到自己的脸颊。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924561
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 然后就溃疡……可难受了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924562
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924563
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924564
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 没问题。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924565
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924566
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 呃，这夹克材质很差，弄得我起疹子，就这样。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924567
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 看到了吗？没什么不正常的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924568
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924569
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924570
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 我可以给你看，不过……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924571
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 说实话，我有点紧张。你也别太苛刻了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924572
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924573
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 怎么样？没问题吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924574
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924575
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924576
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 腋窝……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924577
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924578
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 我知道皮肤瘙痒是伪人的特征。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924579
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 但这都是这件夹克害的。我穿着它出一身的汗，最近又没地方洗澡。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924580
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924581
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924582
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 你想拍就拍，但你的相机看起来有点怪。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924583
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924584
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 哇，这是广告里说的那种灵光照片吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924585
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 说实话，你不像会信那种东西的人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924586
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924587
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924588
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924589
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 耳朵不算伪人特征，对吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924590
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 不过我承认，具体有什么特征，我不太清楚。可能真有耳朵，只是我看漏了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924591
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924592
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 怎么样？都正常吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924593
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924594
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924595
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 我是伪人？！可我的牙齿是歪的啊！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924596
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 求求你别开枪！！！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924597
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924598
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924599
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 等等，我跟你说了，都是因为这件夹克我才起疹子！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924600
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 等等，我手上什么都没有！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924601
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 我不是伪人！！！求求你别开枪！！！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924602
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924603
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924604
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 什么？！我是伪人？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924605
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 可我的眼睛一点都不红啊！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924606
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924607
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924608
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 靠……我真的是伪人吗？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924609
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 真他妈的操蛋！！！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924610
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924611
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924612
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 等等！怎么了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924613
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 是灵光照片显出了什么东西吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924614
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924615
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924616
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 等等，我的耳朵怎么了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924617
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 有什么问题？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924618
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924619
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924620
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 谢谢……你没开枪。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924621
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 我的一生刚才在眼前闪回了一遍。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924622
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 你是故意的，对吧？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924623
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 我的心都跳到嗓子眼了。你为什么要这么做？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924624
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 到底是什么特征？！你到底是……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924625
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 等等……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924626
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 瞳孔抽搐是伪人的特征？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924627
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924628
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 说实话，我连这个都不知道。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924629
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 你改主意，不杀我了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924630
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924631
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 谢谢你没扣扳机，但是……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924632
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 你不确定我到底是不是伪人的话，下次能不能别掏枪把我吓得半死？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924633
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 你以为我夹克上的图案是伪人特征？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924634
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 呼……我还担心有很多黑点呢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924635
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 那灵光相机真邪门……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924636
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 这么说来，我不是伪人？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924637
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924638
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 那你为什么掏枪？到底为什么？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924639
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 妈妈，爸爸……对不起。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73444599668924640
    m_Localized: 'Jacket: 真的对不起……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414656
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我不会任人摆布。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414657
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414658
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414659
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414660
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414661
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414662
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414663
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我犬牙是凸出来的，从小就这样。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414664
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 以前有很多人笑话我，现在没有了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414665
    m_Localized: 'Tough: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414666
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 谁笑话我，我就把对方的牙拔下来。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414667
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414668
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414669
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我喜欢把自己弄的漂漂亮亮的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414670
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 没人说过我漂亮，但是自己觉得自己漂亮，挺好的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414671
    m_Localized: 'Tough: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414672
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 哎哟，我靠。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414673
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 缺了一块儿？怎么会这样？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414674
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 算了……随便了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414675
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414676
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414677
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我这辈子见过的糟心事多了去了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414678
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 都保存在这双眼睛里了。我敢肯定，你只要看得够细，就能看见它们。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414679
    m_Localized: 'Tough: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414680
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 跟我想的一样。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414681
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414682
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414683
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 不可能。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414684
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 你难道也是喜欢检查人腋下的变态？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414685
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我不想再杀人了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414686
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我不想再失望了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414687
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414688
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414689
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我不怎么拍照，不过要拍就拍吧，看看拍出来什么样。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414690
    m_Localized: 'Tough: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414691
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我不太信什么“灵光”，不过……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414692
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 好像是有那么点儿道理。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414693
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414694
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414695
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我才打了耳洞。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414696
    m_Localized: 'Tough: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414697
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我很喜欢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414698
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 以前戴过小耳环，不过一直找不到合适的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414699
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 但是……我感觉这对不错。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414700
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414701
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414702
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 你指错人了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414703
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 这屋子里的怪物绝对不是我。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414704
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414705
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414706
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 怎么，你想让我卸了亚克力美甲？不可能。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414707
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414708
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414709
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我得瞪大眼睛留意身边的所有东西。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414710
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 一点儿都不能放过。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414711
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我也没有办法。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414712
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 这双眼睛看见过那么多东西，要是能忘了一半该有多好。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414713
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 全忘了也无所谓。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414714
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 但不可能说忘就能忘的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414715
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414716
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414717
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 靠……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414718
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414719
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414720
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 但是你觉得不行？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414721
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414722
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414723
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 你到底发现了什么？耳垢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414724
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 你为什么拿枪指着我？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414725
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414726
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414727
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 你是在试探我么？怎么样，我过关了么？我没退缩吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414728
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 不过让人拿枪指着脑袋感觉不太舒服。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414729
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我知道，现在漂不漂亮不重要了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414730
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 但是……看着镜子里的自己那么漂亮，心情还是会变好的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414731
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我讨厌看到外面发生的那些事。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414732
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 但是一时半会儿恐怕不会有什么改变。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414733
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我们能做的只有继续抗争。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414734
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 你真的觉得这么做值得么？想对人开枪就掏枪指着人，扣下扳机？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414735
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 杀了我以后，你会看一眼我的尸体么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414736
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 这个世界烂透了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414737
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 你真的信什么灵光、灵魂一类的东西么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414738
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 你觉得人渣死了以后还是人渣么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414739
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 我一直在想……等一切结束之后，那些容易让人控制的人会怎么样？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414740
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 他们会变成什么样？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414741
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 你真的要扣下扳机吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414742
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 看来……一切到此为止了……我的抗争……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414743
    m_Localized: 'Tough: 最后在一个孤独的疯子家里结束了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414744
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 行，没问题。你想看什么地方？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414745
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414746
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414747
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414748
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414749
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414750
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414751
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 呃……没问题。我时不时抽两口，希望没那么大味道。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414752
    m_Localized: 'Bald: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414753
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 怎么样？一切正常吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414754
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414755
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414756
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 我，呃……有湿疹，所以胳膊上缠着绷带。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414757
    m_Localized: 'Bald: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414758
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 听人说包一下能缓解湿疹。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414759
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 差不多好了。不过我还是想换一下，以防万一。你该不会碰巧有多出来的可以让我用用吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414760
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414761
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414762
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 你可能注意到了，我眼睛上长了这么个难看的东西。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414763
    m_Localized: 'Bald: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414764
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 不知道什么时候冒出来的。不过可把我吓得不轻。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414765
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414766
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414767
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 别吓着，好吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414768
    m_Localized: 'Bald: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414769
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 就是皮肤问题。看见没？我光头，而且全身都有这种斑块。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414770
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 操，我好久没洗澡了。不好意思。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414771
    m_Localized: 'Bald: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414772
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 腋窝就是……腋窝而已。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414773
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414774
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414775
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 我喜欢拍照。开拍吧！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414776
    m_Localized: 'Bald: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414777
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 怎么样？让我看看！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414778
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414779
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414780
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 行啊，没问题。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414781
    m_Localized: 'Bald: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414782
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 说真的，我讨厌掏耳朵。戳深了疼得要命。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414783
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414784
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414785
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 别这样，怎么回事啊？刚才不还好好的……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414786
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414787
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414788
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 好、好，好了！别拿那玩意儿指着我！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414789
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 绷带我不借了，不用你的了，我好得很！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414790
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414791
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414792
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 得了！没事的！我又不是快死了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414793
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 反正看医生也没用。他们看了会怎么说，你也知道。“小病不用治，大病治不了。”'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414794
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 这个？这就是小病。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414795
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414796
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414797
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 你别这么紧张行不行，什么事都没有！别拿枪对着我！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414798
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414799
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414800
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 操，老兄！要是拍得不好我们可以重拍啊！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414801
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 再说了，你相机也有可能是坏了，是不是？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414802
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414803
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414804
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 可我什么都没做啊！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414805
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414806
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414807
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 看不起牙医而已。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414808
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 虽然……我们除了吃的，什么都买不起。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414809
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 我妈时不时会用剩下的布料边角给我缝几件衣服。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414810
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 有一次我和戏剧圈的朋友们喝得烂醉。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414811
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 场面真他妈乱透了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414812
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 我连自己的手都认不出来了。感觉像在看第一人称电影。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414813
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 幸好没干蠢事。穿着不成对的鞋子走回家，但好歹到了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414814
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 不过可把我吓坏了。之后我就戒酒了。再那样喝下去可能会没命的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414815
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 一开始我还是吓得屁滚尿流。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414816
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 我开始胡思乱想，担心自己视力在衰退什么的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414817
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 但没有。这情况已经好几年了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414818
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 治疗？那得花一大笔钱，我出不起。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414819
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 唉，我能说什么呢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414820
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 你很危险，谁生谁死，全在你一念之间。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414821
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 真他妈操蛋。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414822
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 我们有回跟往常一样，聚在一块儿喝酒。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414823
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 几天后，我们发现有个朋友一直没回家。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414824
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 我们把她的照片打印出来，到处贴传单。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414825
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 你猜怎么着？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414826
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 她在路上滑倒了，掉进河里淹死了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414827
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 真他妈操蛋。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414828
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 她是个好女孩。也很漂亮。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414829
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 我过去很喜欢我妈给我掏耳朵。她动作那么轻柔，从来没弄疼过我。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414830
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 但她不能再给我掏耳朵了……再也不可能了……她的手指已经……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414831
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 操……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414832
    m_Localized: 'Bald: 你这混蛋！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414833
    m_Localized: 'Bald: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414834
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 有点像在病房的感觉呢，嘻嘻……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414835
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414836
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414837
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414838
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414839
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414840
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414841
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 那些药让我的牙齿变得薄薄的……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414842
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414843
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 这些尖嘴钳很适合拿来扯我的脸颊，把皮肤一小条一小条地撕下来，撕了一层又一层。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414844
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 撕到流血，撕到感觉到痛，那种痛啊，哎哟……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414845
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414846
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414847
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 我已经不抠指甲了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414848
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414849
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 但有皮翘起来的时候，我还是想撕掉。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414850
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 慢慢地剥下皮肉，这样能感觉到一股灼痛。嘻嘻……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414851
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 这种感觉会持续一阵子。我趁着伤口还新鲜，就放在地上，不停摩呀摩……嗯……又硬，又锋利，又粗糙……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414852
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 这种感觉会持续一阵子。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414853
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414854
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414855
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 我喜欢你的眼睛。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414856
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414857
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 你睡觉的时候，我在看着你，你晚上游荡的时候，我在看着里……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414858
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 你不信任别人吗？嘻嘻……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414859
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414860
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414861
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 他们从没教过我怎么照顾自己。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414862
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 但我看见他们在医院里是怎么潦草地洗澡刷牙的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414863
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414864
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 我以前一直都不会打理自己，嘻嘻。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414865
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 现在我也可以把自己收拾干净了，嘻嘻。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414866
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414867
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414868
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 我不喜欢那样。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414869
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 嗯。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414870
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414871
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 他们以前常嘲笑我……现在他们再也笑不出来了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414872
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414873
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414874
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 我从来不管耳朵怎么样。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414875
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414876
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 毫无意义。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414877
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 管了能怎么样？没有愉悦，没有痛苦。毫无意义。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414878
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414879
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414880
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 粗糙的刷毛刮过牙龈……天啊，太棒了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414881
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 但这个……有点过了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414882
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414883
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414884
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 为什么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414885
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414886
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414887
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 我？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414888
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 我没趁你睡觉时杀你……还没呢！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414889
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 你怎么能这样？怎么能对我这样的小可怜掏枪……嘻嘻……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414890
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414891
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414892
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 怎么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414893
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 我腋窝光溜溜的，我就是恶魔了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414894
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 然而……嘻嘻……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414895
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414896
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414897
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 你……真好呀，嘻嘻。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414898
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414899
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414900
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 你为什么要对我动枪枪呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414901
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 你比我好吗？更干净吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414902
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414903
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414904
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 他们在医院里电焦了我的脑子。滋滋滋！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414905
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 但唯一能帮我的……只有我自己。嘻嘻。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414906
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 我开始咬脸颊后就不抠手指了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414907
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 嘻嘻。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414908
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 拿小枪枪指着知道你在哪儿、什么时候睡觉的人……？嘻嘻……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414909
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 伪人真的和那些格格不入的人有区别吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414910
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 社会憎恨伪人，也憎恨格格不入的人……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414911
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 你怎么分辨？你能分辨吗？你能吗？嘻嘻……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414912
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 我头上有片阴影……嘻嘻……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414913
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 会是什么呢？里面有人吗？还是说，只是种奇怪的光晕？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414914
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 那些条条带带的是什么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414915
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 是……针吗？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414916
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 还是只是漏光？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414917
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 你为什么用枪指着我？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414918
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 是有人叫你这么做的吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414919
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 嗯？是吗？是吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414920
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 不是？……随便想想。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414921
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 嘻嘻……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414922
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: 也许我不该……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414923
    m_Localized: 'Nervous: ……来这儿……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414924
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 你要是觉得这样能放心点儿，那就看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414925
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414926
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414927
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414928
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414929
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414930
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414931
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 看见没？正常得很。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414932
    m_Localized: 'Leper: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414933
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 还很整齐。我身上看着吓人，不过牙齿还是完美的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414934
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 我浑身上下就剩这一个地方是好的了，你不会因为这个杀了我吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414935
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 歪七扭八的。这下可以信我不是伪人了吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414936
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414937
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414938
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 没错，我的手看着也不太好。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414939
    m_Localized: 'Leper: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414940
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 你总不会觉得这算是伪人的特征吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414941
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414942
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414943
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 好，看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414944
    m_Localized: 'Leper: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414945
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 我知道电视上说眼睛发红是伪人的特征，但是我这跟身上长的东西一样，也是天生的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414946
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 忘了说，我眼睛有时候会抽搐一下，但是这跟我身上长的东西一样，也是天生的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414947
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414948
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414949
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 啊？看那儿干嘛？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414950
    m_Localized: 'Leper: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414951
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 好吧，随便你。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414952
    m_Localized: 'Leper: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414953
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 看见没，没什么奇怪的，正常得很。我身上其他地方不好看，但这儿没长什么东西。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414954
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 我腋下也长了点儿东西，跟我身上其他地方一样。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414955
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414956
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414957
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 拍照？照片也算特征么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414958
    m_Localized: 'Leper: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414959
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 行，拍吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414960
    m_Localized: 'Leper: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414961
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 我好像眨了下眼。拍照能看出什么特征来？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414962
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 拍照能看出什么特征来？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414963
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414964
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414965
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 耳朵？什么意思？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414966
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 没恶意，就是想说一句，据我所知伪人的特征好像不包括耳朵吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414967
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 不过你真想看，那就看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414968
    m_Localized: 'Leper: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414969
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 怎么样，有什么奇怪的地方么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414970
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414971
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414972
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 你到底有什么毛病？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414973
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414974
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414975
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 我都跟你说了，我身上这是天生的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414976
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 生下来就这样。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414977
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414978
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414979
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 我都说了，我是得病了才这样！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414980
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414981
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414982
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 你开什么玩笑？！掏枪干嘛？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414983
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414984
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414985
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 等会儿，你这不是普通的相机。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414986
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 是……能拍灵光照片的相机？你就因为这种什么灵魂照片之类的屁话就要杀我？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414987
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414988
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414989
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 你认真的吗？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414990
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 耳朵不是伪人的特征！电视没说！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414991
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414992
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414993
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 靠……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414994
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 你干嘛拿枪指着我？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414995
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 谢谢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414996
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 我还以为你真的会因为我长这样就开枪。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414997
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 靠。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414998
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 你一觉得自己发现了伪人的特征就拔枪？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657414999
    m_Localized: 'Leper: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657415000
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 其他人觉得我有传染病的人，你也没比那群人好到哪儿去。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657415001
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 你脑子没病吧？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657415002
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 骗子鼓捣出来的破烂相机拍张照，就能看得出谁是伪人谁不是了？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657415003
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 要了命了……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657415004
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 你差点把我心脏病吓出来了。谁告诉你耳朵算特征的？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657415005
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 应急中心根本就没说过！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657415006
    m_Localized: 'Leper: 靠，我不想……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 74174599657415007
    m_Localized: 'Leper: ……死……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621056
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaler: 没问题！你想检查什么地方？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621057
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621058
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621059
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621060
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621061
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621062
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621063
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 来，看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621064
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621065
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 我牙齿就没好过，但是刚毕业太忙了，一直没找到机会去看牙医。夏天……真的太忙了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621066
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621067
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621068
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 来，看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621069
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621070
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 都是小时候弄的。我小时候跟人一起去废弃的地方冒险，有一次去到一个地方，地上铺着好多缠在一起的金属线……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621071
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 有个朋友从柜子上摔了下来，柜子直接砸在我手上，金属线就在我手上留下了这个印子……估计会留一辈子吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621072
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 哎，都是才弄的，我……我就是有点儿紧张。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621073
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621074
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621075
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 来，看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621076
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621077
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 一热起来，我眼睛就会变红，冷敷一下会好很多，不过眼下没那个条件。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621078
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 其他人看到我眼睛的颜色，总是说一堆有的没的，有些算好话，有的么……就不是那么中听了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621079
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621080
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621081
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 呃……你非得要看的话……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621082
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 来，看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621083
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621084
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 不好意思，有点儿臭。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621085
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621086
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621087
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 听起来挺有意思的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621088
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621089
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 唔，结果也挺有意思的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621090
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621091
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621092
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 来，看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621093
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621094
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 是有点儿脏，最近没什么工夫打理自己。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621095
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621096
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621097
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 对不起！我会去漱口的！我、我没带牙刷……求你了，别开枪！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621098
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621099
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621100
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 指甲？！我前几天不小心让暗处一块儿松了的金属勾到了而已！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621101
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 就是小时候留下来的伤！除了那个印子，我的手没别的不对劲了！真的！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621102
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621103
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621104
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 我能不能从冰箱里拿点儿冷的东西，敷一敷再说？我从小到大都这样，我、我证明给你看！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621105
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 好吧，不开玩笑了！求你了，别杀我！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621106
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621107
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621108
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 对不起，我没带洗澡的东西，用别人的又太没礼貌了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621109
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621110
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621111
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 你不会因为这么点儿小事就觉得我有问题吧？又不是什么很严重的问题。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780248621112
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009664
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009665
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 我、我会洗干净的！别开枪，求你了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009666
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009667
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009668
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 谢谢你。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009669
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 我会好好刷牙的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009670
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 呼……我有那么一瞬间，还以为你真的会为了一块儿伤疤一枪打爆我的头。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009671
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 眼下这个情况，想好好打理自己的指甲很难。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009672
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 不过以防万一，我会尽量多洗一洗的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009673
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 非常感谢你的理解。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009674
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 一热就发红，我自己有时候也挺烦的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009675
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: ……对了，你眼睛的颜色挺好看的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009676
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 谢谢你没开枪。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009677
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 我会尽量抽空洗一洗的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009678
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 因为张照片就杀人，也太荒唐了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009679
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 拍照有意思归有意思，但我不想把命搭上。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009680
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 谢谢你放我一马，我会尽快弄干净的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009681
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 我去找根棉签掏一掏。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009682
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009683
    m_Localized: 'Fairytaller: 妈妈……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009684
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 来，看吧，反正也没别的事好做了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009685
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009686
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009687
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009688
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009689
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009690
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009691
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 哎哟，刷得太用力，会磨掉牙釉质的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009692
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009693
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 哈哈，我忘了自己缺了颗牙。背后的故事还挺有意思的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009694
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009695
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009696
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 普通的手，干活干多了，糙了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009697
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009698
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 在工厂里干了十四年。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009699
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 卖了这么久力气，为了什么？哈，看看我现在成什么样了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009700
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009701
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009702
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 我虹膜上有个黑色的点点。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009703
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 你看。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009704
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009705
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 弄的我看什么东西都有个黑色的点点。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009706
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 不过时间长了就习惯了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009707
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009708
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009709
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 我打工的厂子早晚会吃官司。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009710
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 我早就该退休了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009711
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009712
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 结果呢，老在湿气重的地方待着，害我这儿长了东西，喏，看见没？擦药膏都没用！他们还好意思让我们把腋毛给剃了！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009713
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 结果呢，老在湿气重的地方待着，害我这儿长了东西，喏，看见没？擦药膏都没用！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009714
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009715
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009716
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 噢，我应该扣好扣子。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009717
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 呃，算了，就拍张照片而已。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009718
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009719
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 不用拿给我看，拿走，我不想看。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009720
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 好吧，我看看拍得怎么样。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009721
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009722
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009723
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 看吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009724
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009725
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 厂子里没什么能弄伤耳朵的东西。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009726
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009727
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009728
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 哇，冷静点儿，别一时上头就不管不顾了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009729
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009730
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009731
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 你怎么忽然这么激动？冷静点儿。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009732
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009733
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009734
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 啊，算了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009735
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 想开就开吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009736
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009737
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009738
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 哈！这样确实能解决所有问题。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009739
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 眨眨眼就能解决！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009740
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009741
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009742
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 啊哈，最明显的特征，就是你手里这把枪！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009743
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009744
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009745
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 你动不动就掏枪挥来挥去，不累么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009746
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009747
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009748
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 好吧，谢谢你没开枪。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009749
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 牙齿的事？不是，我说你刚刚还拿枪指着我，真觉得放下枪就能立马装无事发生，跟我聊天？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009750
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 你能想象得到么？你跟往常一样去上班，到地方人家说你被开了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009751
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 天天累死累活，也不知道为了什么。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009752
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 亏损越来越严重，厂子只好关门。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009753
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 想安安静静地走都不行。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009754
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 你还想听什么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009755
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 不管是你，还是你手里这把枪，我都看得清清楚楚。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009756
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 上帝会来审判你的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009757
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 总算可以退休了吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009758
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 没工作，钱都让银行吞了，太阳还把地上的一切都烤干了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009759
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 多精彩的人生啊，对吧？就跟童话故事一样！哈哈！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009760
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 我家里人一直这样……不知道为什么，拍照就一脸凶相。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009761
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 他们会说“拿相机到这儿来干什么？去拍拍青蛙之类的吧。”'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009762
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 看来我继承了我家里人这点。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009763
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 但是他们就这么吞了我的钱也太不公平了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009764
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 就这么把我们给开了也很不公平。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009765
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 哎，你这人还挺有意思的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009766
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 算了，起码对我来说一切都结束了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009767
    m_Localized: 'FunnyGuy: 我从人生里退休了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009768
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 连整理那些信息报告都勉为其难，那我真不知道他们的筛查工作该有多马虎了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009769
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009770
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009771
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009772
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009773
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009774
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009775
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 事先声明，我可是条真正的商业巨鳄。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009776
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 哈哈哈。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009777
    m_Localized: 'Alt: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009778
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 这么美的东西我怎么可能不精心呵护？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009779
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 其实刚打磨过，牙龈现在还疼呢。不过这样看起来更像个疯子！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009780
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009781
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009782
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 碰上了倒霉事，不小心伤到了指甲。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009783
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 我叫了辆出租车想安安静静去郊区。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009784
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 可是……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009785
    m_Localized: 'Alt: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009786
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 有个傲慢的混蛋把我推开，笑着钻进了车里。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009787
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 呵，我现在还记得清清楚楚，他长了一口完美的大白牙。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009788
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009789
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009790
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 眼睛？我很喜欢，就跟喜欢我身上的纹身一样喜欢。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009791
    m_Localized: 'Alt: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009792
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 你觉得呢？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009793
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009794
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009795
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 我倒是不介意。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009796
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 就是……不太美观。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009797
    m_Localized: 'Alt: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009798
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 可别说我没提醒过你啊。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009799
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009800
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009801
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 哦嚯，你也有相机啊。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009802
    m_Localized: 'Alt: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009803
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 那就看看吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009804
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009805
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009806
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 好吧。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009807
    m_Localized: 'Alt: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009808
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 一帮醉鬼缠着我不放，只能走隧道出来。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009809
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009810
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009811
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 等等。那些“特征”都含糊不清，你不觉得有问题吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009812
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 普通人也会有这些特征。这种笼统的描述……难道不觉得可疑吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009813
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009814
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009815
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 你该不会把我讲的故事套到我身上了吧？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009816
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 你到底觉得我干了什么？我摔倒弄断指甲又不是我的错。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009817
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 你到底觉得我干了什么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009818
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009819
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009820
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 什么？为什么啊？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009821
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009822
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009823
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 别慌，我在洗纹身，只不过天气太热了，就有奇怪的反应。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009824
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 你自己试试就知道了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009825
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 疼得要命，而且浑身汗流个不停。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009826
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009827
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009828
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 我知道，是有点怪。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009829
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 我只是想拍张拉风的照片。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009830
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 绝对没打算拍遗照。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009831
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009832
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009833
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 现在我倒有点后悔走隧道把人甩掉了'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009834
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 让醉汉缠着，哪怕死了，至少也死得个明明白白。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009835
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009836
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009837
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 我想稍微歇会儿，行吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009838
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 被人用死亡威胁，神经有点受不了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009839
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 我可不会因为几片指甲就回城里。门儿都没有。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009840
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 谁知道我踏回那滩浑水会发生什么。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009841
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 我的纹身大多是在亲近的人去世后纹的。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009842
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 像是用墨水封存的记忆。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009843
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 你也看见了，日子不好过。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009844
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 但我失去灵魂伴侣之后……就在眼睛上纹了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009845
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 这样每次照镜子，就还能看见他。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009846
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 真的，最好别在奇怪的地方纹身。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009847
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 可惜没人会为我哀悼。我死后，也没人会保存关于我的记忆。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009848
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 我们活在多么奇怪的时代啊……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009849
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 刚逃离一个马戏团，小丑就跟着我到了这儿来。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009850
    m_Localized: 'Alt: 真吓人。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009851
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 你觉得我被感染了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009852
    m_Localized: 牙齿
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009853
    m_Localized: 手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009854
    m_Localized: 眼睛
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009855
    m_Localized: 腋下
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009856
    m_Localized: 拍照
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009857
    m_Localized: 耳朵
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009858
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 你的意思是……看牙齿能看出来有没有感染伪人病毒？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009859
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009860
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 真有用的话，那好吧……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009861
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009862
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 很整齐，对吧？我们老家的牙医收费不高。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009863
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009864
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009865
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 手？你是想看有没有长什么皮疹之类的东西吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009866
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009867
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 别紧张，晒伤后皮肤会发痒。我可能稍微抓了几下。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009868
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 只是有点晒伤而已。不是感染。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009869
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009870
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009871
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 眼睛？没问题。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009872
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009873
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 可惜太阳太大了，戴墨镜也不顶用。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009874
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 太阳这么大，幸好我戴了墨镜。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009875
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009876
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009877
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 什么？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009878
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009879
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009880
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 说实话，都是天气太热闹的。我一直狂出汗，就起了疹子。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009881
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009882
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009883
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 这是什么检测有没有感染的政府技术吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009884
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 是的话我很乐意试试。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009885
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009886
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 呃……这照片……有点怪。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009887
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 还有照片上的斑点……也很怪。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009888
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009889
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009890
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 有道理。病毒要是通过耳道传播怎么办？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009891
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009892
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 我觉得一切正常。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009893
    m_Localized: 放过
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009894
    m_Localized: 拔枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009895
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 怎么了？有什么问题？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009896
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009897
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009898
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 拜托，我不是都跟你说了么！皮肤痒，我就抓了几下！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009899
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 晒黑什么时候也成症状了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009900
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009901
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 你为什么用那玩意儿指着我？就因为我眼睛发红？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009902
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 你为什么用枪指着我？！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009903
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 我的眼睛完全没问题！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009904
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009905
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009906
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 你是说皮疹是感染伪人病毒的症状？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009907
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009908
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009909
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 凭什么啊？我只是说照片看起来怪！从没见过这样的！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009910
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009911
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009912
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 等等，到底什么问题？我连耳垢都没有！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009913
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009914
    m_Localized: 听对方说完
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009915
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009916
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 你为什么用枪指着我？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009917
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 你能放下枪了吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009918
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 我能理解你的动机，不过你这样太过分了。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009919
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 天呐，我就晒黑了点而已！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009920
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009921
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 你对家里每个人都这样吗？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009922
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 怎么？你不打算开枪？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009923
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 搞什么鬼？！腋窝？现在连这也成症状了？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009924
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 冷静点！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009925
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 你为什么每次都要掏枪？'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009926
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 照片是你说要拍的！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009927
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: ……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009928
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 你疯了吗？那可不是玩具。'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009929
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 别动不动就拿着枪乱挥，不然大家都得让你吓跑！'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009930
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: 靠……我还没……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76332780257009931
    m_Localized: 'Tourist: ……好好看过这个世界……'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94177391876841472
    m_Localized: 开枪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
